<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">- Sala Bible Translation Project</book>
  <para style="h">JONI</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mulumbe Mubotu wa Jesu Kilisitu Wakalembwa a Joni</para>
  <para style="toc2">Joni</para>
  <para style="toc3">Jon</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mulumbe Mubotu Wa Jesu Kilisitu Wakalembwa a</para>
  <para style="mt1">JONI</para>
  <para style="imt">Bupanduluzhi</para>
  <para style="ip">Mulumbe mubotu kwendelana a Joni ngu omwi a mabbuku ali one achizuminano chipya chimpandulula buumi bwa Jesu Kilisitu. Kuli umwi a umwi ulaitwa ati, “Mulumbe Mubotu” ichi chilaamba ati, “Mulumbe Mubotu” zhakalembwa a Jesu nakamana kufa, muli Mateyo a Maako a Luuka a Joni. Mulumbe kweendelana a Joni uyo walo wakalembwa a mutumwa Joni kushikila (90) makkumi fwuka kuzwa kukuzhalwa kwa Kilisitu. Nakuba kwaamba libbuku talyaambi kwaamba John guwakalilemba, kulemba uku kulakozhana a mbwakalemba Joni wakutaanguna, Joni wabili, a Joni watatu. Bamwi bakaindi balembi busena Joni mbwaakali kukkala mu chishi cha ba Efeso a chiindi kushikila libbuku lyakalembwa mu chi Efeso.</para>
  <para style="ip">Joni wakaamba kabotu inchito ya mulumbe wa libbuku kwaamba nkugwasha bantu kushoma kwaamba Jesu ngu Kilisitu, Mwana a Leza upona (20.31) kwiinda mukushoma muli Kilisitu inga mwaba a buumi mu liina lyakwe. Libbuku lyakalembelwa ba Juuda boonse abasololi bataashi ba Juuda. Mulumbe wa John ulimunzhila imwi ipusene kumilumbe iyi yotatwe. Wakalanganya maningi a maleele a Jesu ngakachita alimwi taaku nakalemba maningi mutwambyo. Amwi makani mbuli kubbizhigwa kwa Jesu a kusunkwa mumalundu talembelwe mu Mulembe.</para>
  <para style="iot">Mitwi ya Makani</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Joni wakatalika mulumbe mu chinene 1.1-18,</para>
  <para style="io2">2. Amana wakalemba aanji maleele ngaakachita Jesu (1.19; 12, 50)</para>
  <para style="io3">3. Amana wakapandulula makani aanji mu buumi bwa Jesu bwakamutola kushikila wafa akubuka (13.1; 20, 31)</para>
  <para style="io4">4. Joni wakamanizha mulumbe mu 21 kabandika a chiindi chomwi Jesu naakabonekela kubantu nakabuka kuzwa kubafu alimwi wakatalika nchito yakwe yakulemba libbuku. Ijwi mbulyakasanduka kuba muntu.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1" />
  <para style="s">Ijwi lyakasanduka kuba Muntu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1" />Kumatalikilo Ijwi lyakalinga ko, alimwi Ijwi lyakalinga antomwi a Leza, alimwi Ijwi ngu Leza. <verse eid="JHN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2" />Kuzwa kumatalikilo Ijwi lyakalinga a Leza, <verse eid="JHN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3" />Kwiinda mulinguwe zhintu zhoonse zhakalengwa, natakalinga nguwe ninga takubi icho chakalengwa nachiba chomwi. <verse eid="JHN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4" />Mulinguwe mwakalinga buumi, alimwi buumi ubu bwakalinga ngu mumuni wa bantu boonse. <verse eid="JHN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5" />Mumuni ulamunika mumushiinzhe, alimwi mushiinzhe taukonzhi kukoma. <verse eid="JHN 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6" />Kwakalinga muntu wakatumwa a Leza wa liina lya Joni. <verse eid="JHN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7" />Wakaza mbuli kamboni kwaambila bantu makani amumuni, kwaamba kwiinda muli nguwe boonse banve mulumbe akushoma. <verse eid="JHN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8" />Walo mwiine taaku nakalinga mumuni, wakaza boo kuba kamboni ku mumuni <verse eid="JHN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9" />Uyu wakalinga mumuni wa kashimpe wakalinga kuza munyika akumunika ali uli oonse.<verse eid="JHN 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10" />Wakalinga munyika, alimwi nakuba kwaamba nyika yakalengwa kwiinda mulinguwe, nyika taaku yakamuzhiba. <verse eid="JHN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11" />Wakaza ku chishi chakumuzhaabo, pesi bantu bakwe taaku nibakamutambula. <verse eid="JHN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12" />Kakuli bantu bakamutambula akumushoma mu liina lyakwe wakabapa mumuni wa kwaamba babe bana ba Leza, <verse eid="JHN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13" />Kuba bana taaku nikwakazwila kubazhali babo, nakuba kuyanda kwa muntu, nakuba kuyanda kwa musankwa, pesi kulazwa kuli Leza.<verse eid="JHN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14" />Ijwi lyakaba muntu, alimwi wakaza kukkala akati kesu. Twabona bulemu bwakwe, bulemu bwakwe alimwi Mwana boo eenka, wakaza kuzwa kuli Taata, kazwile nkumbu alimwi a kashimpe.<verse eid="JHN 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15" />Joni wakaamba kujatikizha nguwe wakalila ati, “Ngu oyu ngundakalinga kumwaambila ati, ‘Uza muunshi lyangu munene, nkambo wakalinga kokale ime nshitana kubako.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16" />Kwiinda mu luyando lwakwe twatambula nkumbu, atala a nkumbu zha oyo wakalinga kokale. <verse eid="JHN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17" />Mulawo wakapegwa kwiindila muli Mozesi, abobo nkumbu akashimpe zhakapegwa kwiinda muli Jesu Kilisitu. <verse eid="JHN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18" />Taaku naba omwi wakamubona Leza, pesi Mwaana boo eenka, eenka ngu Leza alimwi uli ku lubazu lwa Baishi, nguwakalenga kwaamba azhibwe. Joni mubbizhi mbwakaka kuba Mesiya.<verse eid="JHN 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bukamboni bwa Joni mubbizhi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mateyo 3.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Maako 1.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luuka 3.1-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19" />Ono ubu mbubu bukamboni bwa bamasololi bamu Jelusalema nibakatuma ba paizhi abama Leevi kubuzha kwaamba ino ndiwe nii?” <verse eid="JHN 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20" />Taaku nakaalilwa kwaamba, pesi wakaamba chakwanguluka ati, “Nshiishi Mesiya.” <verse eid="JHN 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21" />Bakamubuzha ati, “Ino anu ndiwe nii?” “Saa ndiwe Elijah?” Joni wakabanviila ati, “Taaku, nshinshi,”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Bakabuzha ati, “Saa ndiwe mushinshimi?” wakabanviila ati, “Taaku.” <verse eid="JHN 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22" />Kumamanino bakamubuzha ati, “Kotwaambila naa nduweni kwaamba tuunke twaambe kuli babo batutuma. Ino iwe ulalyaamba ati ndiwe nii?” <verse eid="JHN 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23" />Joni wakaamba kwendelana a mushinshimi Izaya mbwakaamba ati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:23">“Ndime jwi lya oyo wongolola mu chimpayuma.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 1:23">Amululamike nzhila ya Mwami.”’<verse eid="JHN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24" />Ono abo ba Faliisi bakatumwa, <verse eid="JHN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25" />bakamubuzha Joni ati, “Ino nchinzhi nchobbizhila naa tooshi Mesiya, naa Elija naa mushinshim?” <verse eid="JHN 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26" />Joni wakanviila ati, “Ndabbizha a maanzhi, pesi akati kanu ali omwi ngumutazhi. <verse eid="JHN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27" />Ngu oyo utokuza kuzwa ndime, nsheeleli akwaangulula ntambo zha nkwabilo zhakwe.” <verse eid="JHN 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28" />Izhi zhoonse zhakachitika mu Betani uli kutala a mulonga wa Jodani, umo Joni mwakalinga kubbizha.<verse eid="JHN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kabelele ka Leza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29" />Ono buzuba bwakachilila Joni wakabona Jesu kaza kuli nguwe, alimwi wakaamba ati, “Amubone Mwana mbelele wa Leza, ugusha chinyonyono cha nyika! <verse eid="JHN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30" />Uyu ngunguwe ngundakalinga kwaamba nindaakaamba ati, “Uuza muunshi lyangu ulanyinda, nkambo nkwaakalinga kale ime nshitana kuzhalwa.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31" />Ime ilwaangu taaku ndakalinga kumuzhi, ono nchindakazila kubabbizha amaanzhi kwaamba azubululwe kuba Izilaili.” <verse eid="JHN 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32" />Alimwi Joni wakapa bumboni ubu ati, “Ndakabona Muuya kauza anshi mbuli nkwilimba kuzwa ku julu akukkala ali nguwe. <verse eid="JHN 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33" />Alimwi ime taaku ndakali kumuzhi, ono Leza wakantuma kubbizha a maanzhi a kwaamba kuli ndime ati, ‘Kufumbwa waakubona muntu ushiakaselukilwe Muuya wangu kuzwa ku julu akumukkala, ukazhibe kwaamba ngu nguwe ubbizha a Muuya Usalala.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34" />Joni wakaamba ati, ndachibona, “Alimwi nda pa bumboni kwaamba uyu ngu Mwana a Leza.”<verse eid="JHN 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bashichiiya ba Jesu bakutaanguna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35" />Buzuba buchilila Joni wakalinga a bashichiiya bakwe bobilo. <verse eid="JHN 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36" />Nakabona Jesu kainda. Wakaamba ati, “Amubone Kabelele wa Leza!” <verse eid="JHN 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37" />Ono bashichiiya bobilo bakanva kaamba ichi, bakamuchilila Jesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38" />Ono nakachebuka Jesu, wakababona kabamuchilila, amane wakababuzha ati, “Ino nchinzhi nchimuyanda?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:38">Bakanviila ati Rabbi (chaamba ati Muii) ino nkuli kokkala?”<verse eid="JHN 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39" />Wakanviila ati kamuza, alimwi mulabona. Amana bakaunka akubona nkwakalinga kukkala, alimwi bakamana buzuba anguyo. Nkambo kwakalinga kale kumangolezha (4 koloko).<verse eid="JHN 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40" />Andulu, a Saimoni mukwabo Petulo, wakalinga umwi wabobilo wakanva chakaamba Joni alimwi mbubakachilila Jesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41" />Chintu chakutaanguna Andulu nchakachita wakalangaula mukwabo Saimoni akumwaambila ati, “Twamujana Mesiya wa Leza (Nkukwaamba Kilisitu.) <verse eid="JHN 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42" />Alimwi wakamutola kuli Jesu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:42">Jesu wakamulanga wakaamba ati, “Saa nduwe Saimoni mwana a Joni, kuzwa ono ulanakwiitwa ati Kefasi.” (Kefasi a Petulo maiina aya alaamba ati libwe).<verse eid="JHN 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu waita Filipo a Natanyeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43" />Nibwakacha Jesu wakayeeya kuunka ku chishi cha Galili, uko nkwakajana musankwa witwa ati Filipo, amana wakamwaambila kwaamba nchilile!” <verse eid="JHN 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44" />Filipo wakalinga kukkala ku Betesaida, munzhi wakalinga kukkala Andulu a Petulo. <verse eid="JHN 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45" />Filipo wakajana Natanyeli, amana wakamwaambila ati, “Twamujana muntu Mozesi ngwa kalemba mu libbuku lya mulawo uyo ulembelwe amumabbuku a bashinshimi. Ngu Jesu waku Nazaleti, mwana a Josefa.” <verse eid="JHN 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46" />Saa kuli chibotu chiinga chazwa mu Nazaleti wakabuzha Natanyeli?” Filipo wakaamba ati koza ulibonene. <verse eid="JHN 1:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47" />Ono Jesu nakamubona Natanyeli kaza kuli nguwe wakaamba ati, “Ngooyu muna Izilaili wanchobeni utabeje!” <verse eid="JHN 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48" />Natanyeli wakabuzha Jesu ati, “Ino wanzhiiba buti?” Jesu wakanviila ati, “Ndalikukubwene kale kochili munshi a chisamu cha mukuyu, katana akukwiita Filipo.” <verse eid="JHN 1:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49" />Amane Natanyeli wakaambilizha Jesu kwaamba ati, “O Muii, nduwe Mwana a Leza! Nduwe Mwami wa Izilaili!” <verse eid="JHN 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50" />Jesu wakanviila ati, “Saa ulashoma nkambo ndamwambila ati ndakubona munshi a chisamu cha mukuyu? Mulakubona zhintu zhinene zhibiibi zhiinda checho!” <verse eid="JHN 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51" />Alimwi wakabaambila ati, “Chanchobeni ndamwaambila mulakubona julu kalijaluka aba ngeli ba Leza kabatanta akuseluka a Mwana Muntu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2" />
  <para style="s">Pobwe lya bwiinga ku Kana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1" />Ono mubuzuba bwatatu pobwe lya bwiinga lyakaba mu munzhi wa Kana mu Galili, abanyina Jesu bakalinga ko. <verse eid="JHN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2" />Alimwi Jesu abashichiiya bakwe bakatambwa ku pobwe lya bwiinga ili. <verse eid="JHN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3" />Ono waini niwakamana, banyina Jesu bakamwaambila ati, “Waini wamana.”<verse eid="JHN 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4" />Jesu wakanviila ati, “Tamwelele kungambila chakuchita,” chiindi changu tachina kushika.”<verse eid="JHN 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5" />Banyina Jesu bakambila basebenzhi ati, “Muchite zhoonse nzheshi amwaambile.”<verse eid="JHN 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6" />Ono kwakalinga nongo zha maanzhi afaafi zhili chisambomwe, zhakapangwa a mabwe ba Juuda nzhibakalinga kusebenzha kusamba mu chiindi cha chiyanza chakulisalazha. Nongo yomwi yakalikuzula makkumi obilo kushika kumakumi otatwe amagaloni amaanzhi (75-115). <verse eid="JHN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7" />Jesu wakaambila basebenzhi ati, “Amuzuzhe maanzhi mu nongo.” Abalo basebenzhi zhoonse bakazhizuzha. <verse eid="JHN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8" />Alimwi wakabaambila ati, “Ono amutekule, mumutolele mwendelezhi upa chakulya mu pobwe, abalo bakatekula, <verse eid="JHN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9" />alimwi mweedelezhi wakalabila maanzhi akasandulwa kuba waini, alimwi taaku naakazhiba kwaamba waini wazwa kuli, (nakuba kwaamba basebenzhi bakatekula maanzhi bakalinga kuzhi.) Amane wakaita shibwinga ambali, <verse eid="JHN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10" />alimwi wakamwaambila ati, “Bantu boonse balataanguna kwaaba waini uli kabotu, alimwi beenzu bamana kukolwa, balaaba waini utali kabotu. Pesi waliyobwela waini mubotu kushikila ono!”<verse eid="JHN 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11" />Ono izhi zhakalinga zhitondezho zhakutaanguna nzhakachita Jesu ku Kana mu Galili, mwakazubulwila bulemu bwakwe, alimwi bashichiiya bakwe bakamushoma.<verse eid="JHN 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12" />Ono nikwakamana Jesu a banyina abamakwabo abashichiiya bakwe bakaunka ku Kapenaumu. Uko nkubakakkala mazuba mashoonto boo.<verse eid="JHN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu wakatanda bakalinga kuuzha mu lubaanza lwa tempele</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-13">Mateyo 21.12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Maako 11.15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:5-46">Luuka 19.5-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13" />Chakalinga chiindi pobwe lya ba Juuda kalili afaafi, abobo Jesu wakaunka ku Jelusalema. <verse eid="JHN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14" />Mu lubanza lwa tempele wakajana bantu kabauuzha ng'ombe, mbelele, a nkwilimba. Bamwi bantu bakalinga kushite amatebulu kabachinchanya maali. <verse eid="JHN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15" />Amane wakabweza chiswepu cha chipaya cha ng'ombe akubatandila asengwe boonse. Wakapalanganya maali abashikuuzha, akutingamuna matebulu abo. <verse eid="JHN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16" />Abo bakalinga kuuzha nkwilimba wakabaambila ati, “Amuzhigushe awa izhi! Mutasanduli ng'anda yaba Taa kuba masambalilo. <verse eid="JHN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17" />Bashichiiya bakwe bakayeeya malembe aamba ati, “Kuyandishisha ng'anda yako, chilantenta mubili wangu anga mulilo.”<verse eid="JHN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18" />Ono ba Juuda bakamubuzha ati, “Ino nzhitondezho nzhi nzhiinga wachita kwaamba tushome ati wakapegwa nguzu kuchita zhintu izhi zhoonse?”<verse eid="JHN 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19" />Jesu wakanviila ati, “Amumwaye tempele iyi, alimwi mu mazuba otatwe ndakwiyaka alimwi.”<verse eid="JHN 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20" />Bakanviila ba Juuda ati, yakatola makkumi one achisambomwe kuyaka tempele iyi, alimwi ulaamba ati inga waiyaka mu mazuba otatwe!” <verse eid="JHN 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21" />Pesi tempele njakalinga kwaamba Jesu mubili wakwe. <verse eid="JHN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22" />Nakabuka kuzwa kubafu, bashichiiya bakayeeya nchakaamba. Bamane bakashoma malembe amajwi Jesu ngakaamba.<verse eid="JHN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu ulizhi bantu boonse mbubabele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23" />Ono Jesu kachili mu Jelusalema chiindi nikwakalinga pobwe lya Pasika, bantu baanji bakabona zhitondezho nzhakachita alimwi bakashoma muliina lyakwe. <verse eid="JHN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24" />Pesi Jesu taaku nakabashoma bantu abo, nkambo wakalinga kubazhi mbubakalinga. <verse eid="JHN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25" />Alimwi taaku nakali kuyanda bumboni bwa bantu amuntu naba omwi, nkambo mwiine wakalikuzhi chakalinga mu moyo wa muntu amuntu.<verse eid="JHN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3" />
  <para style="s">Jesu a Nikodemasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1" />Ono kwakalinga mu Faliisi Nikodemasi, wakalikuzulwilwa mubweendelezhi bwa chi Juuda. <verse eid="JHN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2" />Wakaza kuli Jesu mashiku, akumwaambila ati, “Muii, tulizhi kwaamba iwe nduwe muii wazwa kuli Leza, nkambo taaku muntu unga wachita zhitondezho nzhutokuchita naa Leza katali andiwe.”<verse eid="JHN 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3" />Jesu wakanviila ati, “Nchachobeni, ndakwaambila mashimpe, taaku naba omwi wiinga wabona bwami bwa kujulu kakutaaku kuzhalululwa.”<verse eid="JHN 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4" />Ono Nikodemusi wakabuzha ati, “Ino mbuti muntu mbwiinga wazhaluluwa kali kale munene? Kashimpe inga tabajoki lwabili mulivumo muli banyina kwaamba bazhaluluwe!” <verse eid="JHN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5" />Jesu wakanviila ati, “Nchanchobeni, taaku naba omwi ukonzha kunjila mu bwami bwa Leza chita wazhalululwa mu maanzhi a mu Muuya. <verse eid="JHN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6" />Uzhalwa ku muntu ngu muntu, pesi uzhalwa a muuya ngwa Muuya. <verse eid="JHN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7" />Mutakankamani nkambo ndamwaambila ati mulyeelele kuzhalwa chipya. <verse eid="JHN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8" />Muwo ulaunga kufumbwa nkuyanda, ulaunva muzuzumo wanguwo, pesi inga tamuzhibi nkuuzwa naa kuunka. Chili mbuli oonse wakazhalwa a Muuya.”<verse eid="JHN 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9" />Nikodemasi wakabuzha ati, Ino ichi inga chachitika buti?”<verse eid="JHN 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10" />Jesu wakaamba ati, “Tee iwe uli muii munene mu Izilaili, alimwi nkambo nzhi tozhinvishi zhintu izhi? <verse eid="JHN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11" />Nchanchobeni ndamwaambila ati, tulaamba nchituzhi, alimwi tulapa bukamboni ku zhintu nzhitubona pesi imwe nubantu tamutambuli bukamboni bwesu. <verse eid="JHN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12" />Ndakamwaambila zhintu zha munyika alimwi tamushomi, ino inga mwashoma buti ndamwaambila zhaku julu? <verse eid="JHN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13" />Taaku wakaunka kale ku julu kunze kwa Mwana a Muntu wakazwa ku julu.”<verse eid="JHN 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14" />Bweenka mbuli Mozesi mbwakanyamuna nzoka ya mukuba mu chimpayuma, bweenka awalo Mwana a Muntu mbwelele kusumpulwa, <verse eid="JHN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15" />kwaamba muntu ushoma muli nguwe abe a buumi butamani. <verse eid="JHN 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16" />Obuya Leza mbwakaiyanda nyika wakapa Mwanakwe shimuzhalwa eenka, kwaamba mfumbwa ushoma mulinguwe atafidilili pesi abe a buumi butamani. <verse eid="JHN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17" />Nkambo Leza taaku nakatuma mwanaakwe ano anshi kupa mulandu, pesi kufutula bantu kwiinda muli nguwe.<verse eid="JHN 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18" />Uyo ushoma tapegwi mulandu, pesi uyo utashomi wakapegwa kale mulandu, nkambo taaku nashoma Mwana Leza, shimuzhalwa eenka. <verse eid="JHN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19" />Mbobu lubeta mbulu sebenza, mumuni washika munyika, pesi bantu balayanda mushinzhe kwiinda mumuni, nkambo kamichito yabo ibiibi. <verse eid="JHN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20" />Uyo oonse uchita chibiibi tayandi mumuni, alimwi inga taazi mu mumuni nkambo kakutija chibiibi chabo inga chabonwa. <verse eid="JHN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21" />Pesi uyo oonse uupona mukashimpe ulaza amumuni, kuchita kwaamba nzhibachita zhibonekele kubushu bwa Leza.<verse eid="JHN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu a Joni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22" />Nikwakamana, Jesu abashichiiya bakwe bakaunka ku Judiya uko nkubakakkala kwa chiindi alimwi wakababbizha. <verse eid="JHN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23" />Ono Joni awalo wakalinga kubbizha ku Enoni kufaafi a Salimu nkambo uko kwakalinga maanzhi aanji, alimwi bantu bakalinga kuza kubbizhigwa. <verse eid="JHN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24" />(Mu chiindi ichi Joni katana kubikwa muntolongo.)<verse eid="JHN 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25" />Bamwi bakalinga bashichiiya ba Joni bakatalika kukazhanya amu Juuda umwi kumakani akusanzhanya. <verse eid="JHN 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26" />Bakaza kuli Joni a akwaamba ati, “Muii, ulamuyeeya ulya muntu nguwakalinga anguyo kutala amulonga wa Jodani, ulya eenka ngu wakaamba? Langa utekubbizha ono, amana boonse batokuunka kuli nguwe!”<verse eid="JHN 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27" />Kuli chechi Joni wakanviila ati, “Muntu ulakonzha boo kutambula icho nchaapegwa kuzwa ku julu. <verse eid="JHN 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28" />Imwe mweenka inga mwapa bukamboni nchindakaamba ati, ‘Nshiishi Mesiya pesi ndatumwa kumpela lyakwe.’ <verse eid="JHN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29" />Uyo uchite nabwiinga, ngu shibwiinga. Nakuba bobu mwenzhinyina shibwiinga, ngo oyo wima ampela yakwe akunviila, ulasekelela kwiindilila akambo kajwi lya shibwiinga. Alimwi kusekelela kwangu, ono kwamaninina. <verse eid="JHN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30" />Ulyeelele kuba a bulemu bunene ime ndyelele kucheya.”<verse eid="JHN 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uyo uzwa ku julu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31" />Uyo uzwa ku julu ulainda oonse, uyo uzwa munyika ngwa anyika alimwi ulaamba mbuli wazwa munyika. Uyo uzwa ku julu ulainda boonse. <verse eid="JHN 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32" />Ulapa bukamboni kuchecho nchabona alimwi akunva, pesi taaku naba omwi utambula bukamboni bwakwe. <verse eid="JHN 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33" />Mfumwa ulitambula ulazhibishisha kwaamba Leza ngwa kashimpe. <verse eid="JHN 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34" />Uyo wakatumwa a Leza ulaamba majwi a Leza, nkambo Leza wakamupa Muuya umaninine. <verse eid="JHN 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35" />Taata ulamuyanda Mwana alimwi zhintu zhoonse wazhibika mumanza akwe. <verse eid="JHN 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36" />Uli oonse ushoma mu Mwana ulichite buumi butamani, pesi uyo ukaka Mwaana takaboni buumi, nkambo bukali bwa Leza bulakuba alinguwe.<verse eid="JHN 3:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4" />
  <para style="s">Jesu a mukaintu musamaliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1" />Ono Jesu wakazhiba kwaamba ba Faliisi bakanva kwaamba bantu baanji bakalikumuchilila akubbizhigwa kulinguwe kwiinda Joni. <verse eid="JHN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2" />Nakuba bobu, Jesu mulwakwe taaku nakabbizha naba omwi, pesi bashichiiya bakwe mbubakali kubbizha. <verse eid="JHN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3" />Kumane Jesu nakanva ibyakali kwaambwa, wakazwa ku Judiya akujokekela ku Galili, <verse eid="JHN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4" />Ono mulweendo lwakwe wakali kweelele kwiinda mu munzhi wa Samaliya.<verse eid="JHN 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5" />Wakaza ku munzhi wa Samaliya walikwiitwa ati Sika, afaafi a busena Jakobo mbwakapa mwanaakwe Josefa. <verse eid="JHN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6" />Ku mugodi wa Jakobe, alimwi Jesu kalemane kuzwa mulweendo wakakkala kumbali amugodi, chakalinga chiindi chamalumwi (muma 12 koloko).<verse eid="JHN 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7" />Ono mukaintu umwi Musamaliya wakaza kuteka maanzhi. Jesu wakamwaambila ati, “Ndalomba koo maanzhi nwe.” <verse eid="JHN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8" />Bashichiiya bakwe bakalinga baunka mu munzhi mukuula chakulya.<verse eid="JHN 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9" />Mukaintu wakanviila ati, “Iwe uli mu Juuda, alimwi ime ndimu Samaliya ino inga wanomba buti maanzhi?” (Ba Juuda aba Samaliya tabaswangani.)<verse eid="JHN 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10" />Amane Jesu wakamunviila ati, “Niwalinga kuzhi chipego cha Leza, akuzhiba uyo ukulomba maanzhi akunwa, iwe nuwamulomba maanzhi a buumi.”<verse eid="JHN 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11" />Mukaintu wakanviila ati, “O muii tochite chakutekuzha, alimwi mugodi uyu ngulaamfu, ino maanzhi ayo a buumi inga waateka buti? <verse eid="JHN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12" />Saa uli munene kwiinda Jacobo taata wesu wakatupa mugodi alimwi umo mwakalinga kunwa walo, bana a zhivubwa zhakwe zhoonse?<verse eid="JHN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13" />Jesu wakanviila ati, “Muntu oonse unwa maanzhi aaya ulafa nyotwa alimwi, <verse eid="JHN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14" />pesi mfumbwa muntu unwa maanzhi ngumupa ime, takonzhi kufa nyotwa alimwi. Maanzhi aayo alaakuba mbuli kasensa kamaanzhi katola ku buumi butamani.”<verse eid="JHN 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15" />Mukaintu wakaamba ati, “O muii kompa maanzhi aaya, kwaamba ntakafi nyotwa alimwi, akwaamba nshitazi kuno kuteka maanzhi alimwi.”<verse eid="JHN 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16" />Jesu wakamwambila ati, “Kounka ukaite musankwa wako, ujoke anguwe.”<verse eid="JHN 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17" />Mukaintu wakanviila ati, “Nshichite musankwa.” Amane Jesu wakamwaambila ati, “Ulikabotu naa waamba ati tochite musankwa. <verse eid="JHN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18" />Mashimpe ngakwaamba ati wakalinga kukwetwe kubamasankwa bosanwe, ono uyo ukukwete sunu taashi musankwa wako nchanchobeni waamba chanchobeni.” <verse eid="JHN 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19" />Mukaintu wakaamba ati, “Muii, ndazhiba ono kwaamba uli mushinshimi.” <verse eid="JHN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20" />Bashikale besu bakalinga kukombela mu mulundu uuyu, pesi imwe nuba Juuda mulaamba ati bantu balyeelele kukombela ku Jelusalema.”<verse eid="JHN 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21" />Jesu wakamwaabila ati, “Umukaintu nshome, chiindi chilaakushika nchishi mutakakombi Taata nakuba mu mulundu uuyu naa ku Jelusalema. <verse eid="JHN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22" />Imwe nuba Samaliya mulakomba nchimutazhi, iswe tulakomba nchituzhi nkambo lufutuko lulazwa kuba Juuda. <verse eid="JHN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23" />Ono chiindi chilashika, alimwi chashika kale, nibaya kukomba chakashimpe bakombi balakukomba Taata mu Muuya amukashimpe. Nkambo mbubaabo Taata mbalangaula. <verse eid="JHN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24" />Leza ngu Muuya, alimwi bamukomba balyeelele kumukomba mu Muuya a mukashimpe.”<verse eid="JHN 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25" />Mukaintu wakamwaambila ati, “Ndizhi kwaamba Mesiya (wiitwa ati Kilisitu) “Ulaza, akuza ulaakutwaambila zhoonse.”<verse eid="JHN 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26" />Jesu wakanviila ati, “Uyo utokwaamba kulindiwe, ngu ndime.”<verse eid="JHN 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bashichiiya Bakamusangana Alimwi Jesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27" />Penka awo bashichiiya bakajoka alimwi bakakankamana kumujana kaamba amukaintu. Pesi taaku wakabuzha ati, “Ino ulaandanzhi?” Naa kubuzha ati, “Nkambo nzhi ulaamba anguwe?” <verse eid="JHN 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28" />Ono mukaintu uyu wakashiya nongo yakwe waunka mu munzhi kuyakwaambila bantu kwaamba ati, <verse eid="JHN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29" />“Kamuza mubone muntu wangambila zhintu zhoonse nzhindakachita. Saa ngu Mesiya wa Leza?” <verse eid="JHN 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30" />Ono bantu bakayoboloka kuzwa mu munzhi akunka kuli Jesu.<verse eid="JHN 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31" />Chiindi icho bashichiiya bakamukombelezha kwaamba ati, “O muii, lyako chakulya.”<verse eid="JHN 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32" />Walo wakabanviila ati, “Ime ndichite chakulya nchimutazhi.”<verse eid="JHN 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33" />Bamane bashichiiya bakatalika kulyaambauzha kuli omwi a omwi kwaamba ati, “Saa inga kakuli muntu wamuletela chakulya?”<verse eid="JHN 4:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34" />Ono walo Jesu wakabaambila ati, “Chakulya changu nkuchita kuyanda kwa Leza uyo wakantuma akumanizha mulimo wakwe. <verse eid="JHN 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35" />Tee mulaamba ati, ‘kwashaala myeenzhi yone boo kwaamba tutebule.’ Pesi ndamwaambila kwaamba amubone myuunda, mulange maila mbwaayuma kale, alalindila boo kutebulwa! <verse eid="JHN 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36" />Shikutebula ulavola munchito yakwe, ulabunjika michelo itola ku buumi butamani kwaamba uuyo wakashanga autebula bakomane antomwi. <verse eid="JHN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37" />Kashimpe aka kaambyo kaamba ati, ‘Umwi mushangi, umwi mutebuli.’ <verse eid="JHN 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38" />Ndamutuma kutebula nzhimwatakasebenzela. Bamwi bakasebenza nchito iyumu, alimwi imwe mwatebula bulumbu bwabo.”<verse eid="JHN 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39" />Ba Samaliya baanji bakazwa mumunzhi bakashoma muli Jesu nkambo kamazwi akaamba mukaintu kwaamba ati, “Wangaambila zhoonse nzhidakachita.” <verse eid="JHN 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40" />Ono ba Samaliya nibakashika kuli Jesu, bakamulomba kwaamba akkale ambabo mazuba obilo.<verse eid="JHN 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41" />Alimwi nkambo kamajwi akwe bantu baanji bakaba bashomi. <verse eid="JHN 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42" />Bakaambila mukaintu uyu ati, “Twashoma kutaashi boo makani ako, ono nkambo twalinvida tubeene, alimwi twazhiba kwaamba nchobeni uyu ngu Mufutuli wa nyika.”<verse eid="JHN 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu wakaponya mwana a mwendelezhi munene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43" />Ono nikwakainda mazuba obilo, Jesu wakazwa mu munzhi akunka kuchishi cha Galilii. <verse eid="JHN 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44" />Jesu mwiine nguwa kaamba ati, “Taaku mushinshimi ulemekwa nkwazwa.” <verse eid="JHN 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45" />Naakashika ku Galilii, bantu bachishi iichi bakamutambula kabotu, nkambo bakabona zhoonse izho nzhakachita mu Jelusalema chiindi cha pobwe lya Pasika. Nkambo abalo nkubakalinga.<verse eid="JHN 4:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46" />Jesu nakashika alimwi kumunzhi wa Kana ku Galili, uko nkwaakasandula maanzhi kuba waini. Alimwi kwakalinga umwi wachinenenene wakalikuchite mwana mulwazhi ku Kapenaumu. <verse eid="JHN 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47" />Naakanva kwaamba Jesu wazwa kuchishi cha Judiya akuza ku Galili, wakaza kulinguwe akumulomba kwaamba akaponye mwana, nkaambo wakali kuyanda kufa. <verse eid="JHN 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48" />Jesu wakamwaambila ati, chita imwe mwabona zhitondezho a zhikankamika,” “Taaku naba omwi ukonzha kushoma.”<verse eid="JHN 4:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49" />Ono uyu muntu wachinenenene wakaambila Jesu ati, “O muii, koza mwana angu katana akufa.”<verse eid="JHN 4:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50" />Amana Jesu wakamwaambila ati, “Kounka boo, mwana ako ulapona.” Muntu uyo wakashoma majwi akaamba Jesu, wakaunka ku munzhi wakwe. <verse eid="JHN 4:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51" />Kachili munzhila, bazhike bakwe bakamuchingauzha akumwaambila ati, “Mwanaako ulapona!”<verse eid="JHN 4:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52" />Ono wakababuzha chiindi mwana nchakalinva kabotu. Bakaamba ati, “Chakalinga chiindi cha malumwi (1 koloko) nakalinva kabotu.” <verse eid="JHN 4:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53" />Amane baishi bakazhiba kwaamba nchi chiindi Jesu nchakaamba kwaamba mwanaako ulapona.” Ono walo aba ng'anda yakwe boonse bakashoma.<verse eid="JHN 4:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54" />Ichi nchichitondezho chabili Jesu nchaakachita nakazwa muchishi cha Judiya kuunka muchishi cha Galilii.<verse eid="JHN 4:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5" />
  <para style="s">Kuponeshegwa kukazhiba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1" />Muchindi chimwi, Jesu wakaunka ku Jelusaluma ku pobwe imwi yaba Juuda. <verse eid="JHN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2" />Ono mu Jelusalema, kumbali amulyango wambelele, kwalinga kazhiba kakali kwiitwa ati Betisada muchi Hibulu. Ono kuchizhiba ichi kwakalikuyakilwe zhinvuka zhosanwe. <verse eid="JHN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3" />Mu zhivuka umo mwakalinga koona balwazhi baanji, mbuli boofu, balema a bayuminine mibili, bakalinga kulindilila kuvundaulwa kwamaanzhi muchiziba. <verse eid="JHN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4" />Ono chiindi achiindi mungeli wa Leza wakalinga kuza kunjila mukazhiba akuvundaula maanzhi. Abobo kufumbwa mulwazhi wafambana kuliwaala mukazhiba chiindi maanzhi nakavundaulwa wakalikupona kubulwazhi bwakwe. <verse eid="JHN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5" />Ono muchivuka chimwi kwakalinga muntu umwi wakachiswa kwa myaaka ili makkumi otatwe amyaka ili lusele. <verse eid="JHN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6" />Ono Jesu nakamubona kaonene alimwi wakazhiba kwaamba wakachiswa kwa chiindi chilaanfu. Wakaamba kuli nguwe ati, “Saa ulayanda kuponeshegwa?”<verse eid="JHN 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7" />Mulwazhi wakanviila ati, “O Mwami, “Nshichite wakungwasha kungwaala mukazhiba chiindi maanzhi avundaulwa. Ndayanda kunjila, ndajana umwi wanyindila waliwaalila kale.”<verse eid="JHN 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8" />Amane Jesu wakamwaambila ati, “Nyamuka! Bweza mpasa yako uunke.” <verse eid="JHN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9" />Peenka penka muntu uyu wakapona, wakabweza mpasa yakwe akunka.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 5:9">Alimwi ichi chakachitika buzuba bwa Nsabata, <verse eid="JHN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10" />alimwi banene babama Juuda bakaamba kumuntu uyu wakaponeshegwa ati, “Sunu mbuzuba bwa Nsabata, toelele kunyamuna mpasa yako.”<verse eid="JHN 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11" />Walo wakanviila ati, “Uyo wampoonya wangambila ati bweza mpasa yako uunke.”<verse eid="JHN 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12" />Bakamubuzha ati, “Ino muntu nzhi uyo wakwaambila kuchita ichi?”<verse eid="JHN 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13" />Uyo muntu wakaponyeshegwa taaku nakazhiba kwaamba naa muntu uyu nguni, nkambo Jesu wakanjila mu bantu baanji mubusena ubo.<verse eid="JHN 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14" />Nikwakainda boo kaiindi, Jesu wakamujana muntu uyu mu tempele alimwi wakamwambila ati, “Bona, ono wapona, uchileke kubisha nkambo chimwi chintu chinene chiinda awa inga chakukuchitikila.”<verse eid="JHN 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15" />Amane wakaunka waambila basololi baba Juuda ati ngu Jesu wakamuponya.<verse eid="JHN 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16" />Ono nkambo Jesu wakalikuchita izhi zhintu mu Nsabata, basololi baba Juuda bakatalika kumupenzha. <verse eid="JHN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17" />Ono Jesu mukulikwabilila wakabanviila ati, “Taata ulasebenza chiindi choonse, alimwi andime ndyelele kusebenza.”<verse eid="JHN 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18" />A kambo aka ba Juuda bakelezha kujana nzhila yakumujaya Jesu. Bakaamba ati watyola mulawo wa buzuba bwa Nsabata, akulyaamba ati Leza ngu Ishi. Kulibika muchiimo chomwi a Leza.<verse eid="JHN 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nguzu zha Mwaana a Leza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19" />Jesu wakabanviila ati, “Nchanchobeni ndamwaambila, Mwaana inga tachiti chintu eenka, ulachitabo izho nzhabona Baishi kabachita. Nkambo Baishi nchibachita awalo mwaana ulachita. <verse eid="JHN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20" />Nkambo Taata ulanda Mwaana alimwi ulamutondezha zhoonse nzhachita. Kashimpe, ulakumutondezha zhintu zhinene zhiinda izhi, kuchita kwaamba imwe mukakankamane. <verse eid="JHN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21" />Nkaambo bweenka Baishi mbubabusha bafu akupa buumi, mbumbubo bweenka Mwaana awalo mbwaapa buumi kufumbwa muntu ngwinga wayanda kupa. <verse eid="JHN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22" />Nakubabobo, Baishi tababeteki uli oonse, pesi bakapa Mwaana kwaamba abeteke boonse, <verse eid="JHN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23" />kwaamba bantu boonse balemeke Mwaana bweenka mbuli mbwalemeka Baishi. Muntu woonse utalemeki Mwaana talemeki Baishi bakamutuma.<verse eid="JHN 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24" />“Nchanchobeni ndamwaambila, aabo banva majwi angu akushoma uyo wakantuma ulichete buumi butamani alimwi tabakabetekwi pesi bainda kale mu lufu kuunka ku buumi. <verse eid="JHN 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25" />Nchanchobeni ndamwaambila ati, chiindi chilashika, alimwi chashika kale, bafile nishibakanve ijwi lya Mwana Leza, alimwi abo beshibakanve balakuba abuumi. <verse eid="JHN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26" />Nkambo bweenka mbuli Baishi mbubachite buumi, awalo Mwana wakamupa kwaamba abe abuumi mulinguwe mwiine. <verse eid="JHN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27" />Alimwi wakapa Mwaana nguzu zhakubeteka, nkambo ngu Mwana a Muntu. <verse eid="JHN 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28" />Mutakankamani achechi, nkambo chilaakushika chiindi boonse bali muzhuumbwe neshibakanve ijwi lyakwe, <verse eid="JHN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29" />alimwi akuzwa muzhuumbwe. Abo bakachita kabotu balakubukila ku buumi butamani, abalo bakachita zhibiibi balakubukila ku chisubulo.<verse eid="JHN 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bumboni bwiimikanina Jesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30" />Taaku nchiinga ndachita muguzu zhangu, ndabeteka mbuli mbunva, alimwi lubeta lwangu lulasalala, nkaambo nshichiti kwiinda mukuyanda kwangu pesi uyo wakantuma.<verse eid="JHN 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31" />“Naa ndalipa bumboni bwangu ndimwiine, bumboni bwangu tabushi bwakashimpe. <verse eid="JHN 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32" />Nkwaali umwi upa bukamboni ali ndime alimwi ndizhi kwaamba bumboni bwakwe mbwakashimpe. <verse eid="JHN 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33" />Mwakatuma kuli Joni alimwi wakapa bumboni bwakashimpe. <verse eid="JHN 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34" />Kutaashi kwaamba ndatambula bumboni buzwa ku bantu, pesi ndakachitila kwaamba mufutulwe. <verse eid="JHN 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35" />Joni wakalinga lilampi lyakalikuyaka akupa mumuni, alimwi imwe mwakasala kusekelela kukkala mu mumuni wakwe kwa kaindi kashoonto. <verse eid="JHN 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36" />Ndichite bumboni bunene bwiinda bwa Joni. Nkambo milimo Taata njakampa kwaamba nkamanizhe iyo milimo njitekuchita ilatondezha kwaamba Taata wakantuma. <verse eid="JHN 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37" />Alimwi Taata wakantuma, wakapa bumboni bujatikizha ndime. Taaku nimwakanva ijwi lyakwe naa kubona bube bwakwe, nakuba ijwi lyakwe kukkala mulindimwe, nkambo tamushomi uyo ngwakatuma, <verse eid="JHN 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38" />naa ijwi lyakwe lilapona mulindimwe, kwaamba kamutashomi uyo ngwaakatuma. <verse eid="JHN 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39" />Mulaabala malembe chakushinizha nkambo mulayeya kwaamba mulingayo mulajana buumi butamani, alimwi aya eenka malembe alaamba alindime! <verse eid="JHN 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40" />Pesi mulakaka kuza kulindime kwaamba mujane buumi.<verse eid="JHN 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41" />“Ime nshilangauli kulumbaizhigwa kuzwa ku bantu. <verse eid="JHN 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42" />Pesi ndimuzhi, kwaamba tamuchite luyando lwa Leza mu myoyo yanu. <verse eid="JHN 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43" />Ndaza mu nguzu zha Taata, nikuba bobu tamuna kuntambula, alimwi naa umwi waza mu nguzu zhakwe inga mwamutambula. <verse eid="JHN 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44" />Ino inga mwanshoma buti naakamuzumina kulumbaizhigwa kuzwa kuli omwi a omwi pesi kamutalangauli kulumbaizhigwa kuzwa kuli Leza boo eenka? <verse eid="JHN 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45" />Mutayeeyi kwaamba ndakumubejekesha kuli Taata, Mozesi ngushi akamubejekeshe uyo ngumuchiteleko bulangizhi. <verse eid="JHN 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46" />Ono naamwakamushoma Mozesi, nimwakanshoma andime nkambo wakalemba alindime. <verse eid="JHN 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47" />Pesi nkambo tamushomi nchakalemba, ino inga mwashoma buti nchingamba?”<verse eid="JHN 5:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6" />
  <para style="s">Jesu wakasanina zhuulu zhosanwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mateyo 14.13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Maako 6.30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luuka 9.10-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1" />Jesu wakazubuka kutala a lweenge lwa Galilii luli ngu Taibeliyasi. <verse eid="JHN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2" />Alimwi mabunga mabunga a bantu akamuchilila nkambo bakabona zhitondezho nzhaakachita kwiinda mukuponya balwazhi. <verse eid="JHN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3" />Amane Jesu wakaunka amulundu akukkala abashichiiya bakwe. <verse eid="JHN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4" />Pobwe ya Pasika yaba Juuda yakalinga afaafi. <verse eid="JHN 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5" />Jesu nakalanga wakabona imbunga ya bantu kabaza kulinguwe. Wakabuzha Filipo ati, “Ino nkuli nkushituule chinkwa chakusanina bantu boonse aba?” <verse eid="JHN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6" />Wakabuzha kuyanda kumusola, nkambo wakalikuzhi kale chakuchita.<verse eid="JHN 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7" />Filipo wakamunviila ati, “Kwaamba omwi ajane kuluma kampanzhi kashoonto chilabweza maali avolwa mu myeenzhi ili chiloba.”<verse eid="JHN 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8" />Ono umwi waba shichiiya wakwe, Andulu mukwabo Saimoni Petulo, wakaamba ati, <verse eid="JHN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9" />“Ngoyu mwaana musankwa uchite zhinkwa zhili zhosanwe zha maila atuswi tobilo. Pesi ino inga zhaba buti zhiinji kwabana bantu baanji boonse aaba.”<verse eid="JHN 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10" />Jesu wakaamba ati, “Amubaambile bantu boonse bakkale anshi.” Abusena awo akalinga bwiizu buunji. Amane bakakkala anshi, (bamasankwa bakakkala bakalinga kushika zhuulu zhosanwe). <verse eid="JHN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11" />Jesu wakabweza zhinkwa, wakapa kulumba kuli Leza, amane wakazhaaba kubantu bakalikushite. Wakachita bweenka a ku tuswi. <verse eid="JHN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12" />Ono boonse nibakakuta, wakakaambila bashichiiya bakwe ati, “Amubike antomwi zhoonse zhachaala. Kutabi nachiba chomwi chisowegwa.” <verse eid="JHN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13" />Bakazhibika antomwi zhakashaala zhoonse akuzuzha mitaanga ili makkumi obilo atobilo ngubakashiya bakalinga kulya.<verse eid="JHN 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14" />Ono bantu nibakabona chitondezho Jesu nchakachita, bakatalika kwaamba ati, “Kashimpe ngunguwe mushinshimi utokuza munyika!” <verse eid="JHN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15" />Ono Jesu kaazhi kwaamba balanda kumubika abwami chakumushinikizha, wakajokela a mulundu eenka.<verse eid="JHN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu wakeenda a maanzhi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Mateyo 14.22-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Maako 6.45-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16" />Ono chiindi cha mangolezha, bashichiiya bakwe bakaunka ku chizhiba, <verse eid="JHN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17" />uko nkubakanjila mu bwaato, bamane bakazubuka baunka ku Kapenaumu. Ono kakuli kwashiya kale, alimwi Jesu katana kuza kulimbabo. <verse eid="JHN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18" />Muuwo unene wakaunga alimwi maanzhi akalikuvundauka changuzu. <verse eid="JHN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19" />Ono nibakakwasula musinzo wa makilomita osanwe kushika ku chiloba, bakamubona Jesu kaza ku bwaato, kaeenda a maanzhi, alimwi bakatija. <verse eid="JHN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20" />Jesu wakabaambila ati, “Ndime, mutatiji!” <verse eid="JHN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21" />Amane bakamunjizha mu bwaato, peenka penka bwaato bwakashika kutala nkubakalinga kuunka.<verse eid="JHN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bantu bakamulangaula Jesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22" />Buzuba bwakachilila imbunga yakashaala kutala achizhiba yakazhiba ati kwakashaala boo bwaato bomwi, akwaamba Jesu taaku nakabunjila bwaato abashichiiya bakwe, pesi bakaunka boo beenka. <verse eid="JHN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23" />Amana amwi maato akazwa ku Tibeliyasi akashikila afaafi abusena bantu nkubakalida chinkwa nakamana kupa kulumba kuli Leza. <verse eid="JHN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24" />Amana mbunga yakazhiba kwaamba Jesu naa bashichiiya bakwe tibakalinga koo abusena awo. bakanjila mumato akunka ku Kapenaum, mukulangaula Jesu.<verse eid="JHN 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu chi chinkwa cha buumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25" />Ono bantu nibakamujana Jesu kutala, bakamubuzha ati, “O muii, ino washika lili kuno?”<verse eid="JHN 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26" />Jesu wakanviila ati, “Nchachobeni ndamwaambila, mulalangaula ndime, kutaashi nkambo kazhitodezho nzhindakachita pesi nkambo mwakalya zhinkwa akukuta. <verse eid="JHN 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27" />Mutasebenzeli chakulya chimana, pesi chakulya chipa buumi butamani, icho Mwana a Muntu ncheshi akamupe. Nkambo Leza Taata alinguwe wakabika chinamatizho chakuzumizha.”<verse eid="JHN 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28" />Ono bakamubuzha ati, “Ino nchizhi nchiinga twachita kwaamba tuchite Leza nchayanda?”<verse eid="JHN 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29" />Jesu wakanviila ati, “Leza nchayanda kuchita nkushoma muli uyo ngwakatuma.”<verse eid="JHN 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30" />Ono wakamubuzha ati, “Ino chitondezho nzhi nchishiukatondezhe kwaamba tukabone akukushoma? Ulakuchita buti? <verse eid="JHN 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31" />Bashikale besu bakalya mana mu chimpayuma, mbuli mbukulembelwe, “Wakabapa chinkwa kuzwa ku julu kwaamba balye.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32" />Jesu wakabaambila ati, “Nchanchobeni taashi Mozesi wakamupa chinkwa kuzwa ku julu pesi ngu Taata umupa chinkwa cha kashimpe kuzwa ku julu. <verse eid="JHN 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33" />Nkambo chinkwa cha Leza nchinkwa chiza anshi kuzwa ku julu alimwi chilapa buumi kunyika.”<verse eid="JHN 6:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34" />Bakamwaambila ati, “O muii, kotupa chinkwa ichi lyoonse.”<verse eid="JHN 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35" />Amane Jesu wakaamba ati, “Ndime chinkwa cha buumi. Kufumbwa muntu uza kuli ndime takafi nzala alimwi, a oyo ushoma muli ndime, takafi nyotwa alimwi. <verse eid="JHN 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36" />Pesi mbuli mbundakamwaambila kale, mwambona alimwi tamuchishomi. <verse eid="JHN 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37" />Pesi boonse abo mbashiakampe Taata balakuza kulindime nshikabatandi. <verse eid="JHN 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38" />Nkambo ndakaza ano anshi kuzwa ku julu kutaashi kwaamba naa nchite luyando lwangu pesi luyando lwa oyo wakantuma. <verse eid="JHN 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39" />Alimwi ulu ndu luyando lwa oyo wakantuma, kwaamba ntasowekelwi naba omwi uyo ngwakampa, pesi kubabusha mubuzuba bwamamanino. <verse eid="JHN 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40" />Nkambo kuyanda kwa Taata mbwakwaamba ati uli oonse ulanga ku Mwaana akumushoma nkamubushe mubuzuba bwamamanino.<verse eid="JHN 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41" />Ono ku kaambo aka ba Juuda bakatalika kumutongooka nkambo wakaamba ati, “Ndime chinkwa chiza anshi kuzwa ku julu?” <verse eid="JHN 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42" />Bakaamba ati, “Ino uyu taashi Jesu mwana Josefa? Baishi abanyina mbutuzhi? Ina ono inga waamba buti ati, ‘Ndaza anshi kuzwa ku julu?”<verse eid="JHN 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43" />Jesu wakanviila ati, “Amuleke kukazhana akati kanu. <verse eid="JHN 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44" />Taaku muntu ukonzha kuza kulindime chita Taata wakantuma wamuswenya afaafi, alimwi ndakumubusha buzuba bwamamanino. <verse eid="JHN 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45" />Bashinshimi bakalemba ati, ‘Balakuiishigwa a Leza boonse. mfumbwa unva kuzwa kuli Taata akwiiya kuzwa kulinguwe ulaza kulindime. <verse eid="JHN 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46" />Taaku wakamubona kale Taata, chita boo uyo uzwa kuli Leza. Nguwakamubona boo. <verse eid="JHN 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47" />Nchanchobeni ndamwambila, mfumbwa ushoma ulichite buumi butamani. <verse eid="JHN 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48" />Ndime chinkwa cha buumi. <verse eid="JHN 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49" />Bashikale banu bakalya mana mu chimpayuma pesi bakafa. <verse eid="JHN 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50" />Pesi nchechi chinkwa chiza anshi kuzwa ku julu, icho uli oonse nchinga walya akutafa. <verse eid="JHN 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51" />Ndime chinkwa chipa buumi chakazwa ku julu, mfumwa ulya chinkwa ichi ulakupona lyoonse. Chinkwa ichi mubili wangu, ngushi nkape buumi ku nyika.”<verse eid="JHN 6:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52" />Bamane bama Juuda bakatalika kukazhanya changuzu mulichabo ati, “Ino muntu uyu inga watupa buti mubili wakwe kwaamba tulye?”<verse eid="JHN 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53" />Ono Jesu wakabaambila ati, “Nchanchobeni ndamwambila ati, mwatalya mubili wa Mwana a Muntu akunwa bulowa bwakwe, tamukabi a buumi muli ndimwe. <verse eid="JHN 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54" />Mfumbwa muntu ulya mubili wangu akunwa bulowa bwangu ulichite buumi butamani, alimwi ndakubabusha mu buzuba bwamamanino. <verse eid="JHN 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55" />Nkambo mubili wangu nchakulya chanchobeni, abwalo bulowa bwangu nkukunwa kwanchobeni. <verse eid="JHN 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56" />Mfumbwa ulya mubili wangu akunwa bulowa bwangu ngukalilila muli ndime, andime muli nguwe. <verse eid="JHN 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57" />Bweenka mbuli Taata upona mbwakantuma abobo andime ndapona ankambo ka Taata. Alimwi mfumbwa ulya mubili wangu ulakupona nkambo kangu. <verse eid="JHN 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58" />Ichi nchichinkwa chakazwa ku julu, bashikale banu bakalya maana alimwi bakafa, pesi mfumwa ulya chinkwa ichi ulakupona kukabe kutamani.”<verse eid="JHN 6:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59" />Jesu wakaamba makani aya nakalinga kuiisha mu sinagogo mu Kapenaumu.<verse eid="JHN 6:59" /></para>
  <para style="s">Majwi apa buumi butamani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60" />Ono bashichiiya baanji nibakanva makani aya bakaamba ati, makani aya manene. Nguni ukonzha kwanva?”<verse eid="JHN 6:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61" />Jesu wakazhiba kwaamba bashichiiya bakwe bakalinga kutongooka akambo kachechi, wakabaambila ati, “Saa ichi chamutyompa? <verse eid="JHN 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62" />Ino naa mwabona Mwana a Muntu katanta kujokela uko nkwakalinga kutaanguna? <verse eid="JHN 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63" />Muuya ulapa buumi, muntu takonzhi kuba a buumi ubu mwiine. Majwi aya ngumwaambila alizwile Muuya a buumi. <verse eid="JHN 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64" />Kakuli bamwi banu tabashomi.” Nkambo Jesu wakalinga kuzhi kuzwa kumatalikilo abo batakalinga kushoma a oy shikumwaaba. <verse eid="JHN 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65" />Alimwi wakayungizha wakaamba ati, “Aka nkukambo nchindamwaambilila ati taaku ukonzha kuza kulindime chita boo Taata wabazumizha.”<verse eid="JHN 6:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66" />Kuzwa chiindi ichi bashichiiya baanji bakajokela alimwi bakachileka kumuchilila. <verse eid="JHN 6:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67" />Jesu wakabuzha bali kkumi abobilo ati, “Saa andimwe mulayanda kunshiiya?”<verse eid="JHN 6:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68" />Saimoni Petulo wakamunviila ati, “Mwami, ino inga iswe twaunka kuli nii? Iwe ndiwe uchite majwi abuumi butamani. <verse eid="JHN 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69" />Iswe tulashoma akuziba ati ndiwe Usalala uzwa kuli Leza.”<verse eid="JHN 6:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70" />Jesu wakabaambila ati, “Saa nshina kumusala numuli kkumi abobilo,” Pesi umwi wanu ngu Satani!” <verse eid="JHN 6:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71" />Wakalinga kwaamba Judasi mwana Saimoni Sikalyoti, nkambo uyu nikuba kwaamba wakalinga wankamu yabali kkumi abobilo ngunguwe wakalinga kumwaaba.<verse eid="JHN 6:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7" />
  <para style="s">Jesu abamakwabo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1" />Ono ichi nichakainda, Jesu wakalinga kweenda muchishi cha Galili. Taaku nakayanda kushika ku chishi cha Judiya nkambo ka kwaamba bamasololi baba Juuda bakalinga kulangaula nzhila yakumujaila mo. <verse eid="JHN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2" />Chiindi cha pobwe yaba Juuda ya matente yakalinga afaafi, <verse eid="JHN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3" />Bamakwabo Jesu bakamwaambila ati, “Kozwa mu Galilii alimwi uunke ku Judiya, kwaamba bashichiiya bako bakabone nchinto njochita. <verse eid="JHN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4" />Taaku muntu uyanda kuzhibwa uchita zhintu kumbali. Ono nkambo utokuchita zhintu izhi, litondezhe ku nyika!” <verse eid="JHN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5" />(Nkambo abamakwabo taaku bakamushoma.)<verse eid="JHN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6" />Abobo, Jesu wakabaambila ati, “Chiindi changu tachinakushika, ono kulindimwe chiindi choonse nchibotu. <verse eid="JHN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7" />Nyika taikonzhi kumusulaika, pesi ime ilansulika nkambo ndabaambila milimo yanjiyo ibiibi. <verse eid="JHN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8" />Kamunka ku pobwe ime tenshinguke, nkambo chiindi changu tachina kushika.” <verse eid="JHN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9" />Nakamana kwaamba wakashaala mu Galilii.<verse eid="JHN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu ku pobwe ya matente</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10" />Ono muunshi bamakwabo kabali baunka kale ku pobwe, wakaunka awlo chakuyubilila kutaashi chantangalala <verse eid="JHN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11" />Ono ku pobwe basololi baba Juuda bakalinga kulangula Jesu, kababuzha ati, “Ino uli kuli?” <verse eid="JHN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12" />Akati ka mbunga ya bantu bakalinga kutepeta kabakazhanya amakani akwe. Bamwi bakalinga kwaamba ati, “Ngu Muntu mubotu.” Bamwi bakalinga kwaamba ati, “Taaku, ulabeja, utokusowa bantu.” <verse eid="JHN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13" />Ono nkambo kakutija ba Juuda bakalinga kushoma taaku muntu wakaamba ali Jesu chantangalala.<verse eid="JHN 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14" />Ono pobwe nilyakashika akati kati Jesu wakaunka mulubaanza lwa tempele akutalika kuiisha. <verse eid="JHN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15" />Ono ba Juuda bakalinga kuya bakakankamana alimwi bakabuzha ati, “Ino uyu muntu walujana kuli lwiiyo ulu katana kuiishigwa?”<verse eid="JHN 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16" />Jesu wakanviila ati, “Kuiisha uku kulazwa kuli Leza uyo wakantuma. <verse eid="JHN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17" />Mfumbwa usala kuchita kuyanda kwa Leza ulakuzhiba naa mbinjiisha bilazwa kuli Leza naa mbyaangu boo ndimwiine <verse eid="JHN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18" />Mfumbwa waamba alwakwe mwiine ulanda bulemu bwakwe mwiine, pesi uyo ulangaula bulemu bwa oyo wakamutuma ngu muntu wakashimpe, alimwi muli nguwe taamu luchengo. <verse eid="JHN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19" />Saa Mozesi taaku nakamupa milawo? Pesi taaku naba omwi uichilila milawo. Ina nkambo nzhi nchimuyanda kunjaila?”<verse eid="JHN 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20" />Imbunga yakanviila ati, “Ulichite muuya ubiibi!” “Nguni uyanda kumujaya?”<verse eid="JHN 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21" />Jesu wakabaambila ati, “Ndakachita chitondezho chiindi chomwi, amana boonse mwakakankamana. <verse eid="JHN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22" />Mozesi wakamupa chiyanza chakupalulwa (nakuba ati chiyanza ichi taaku nichakalinga chaakwe ncha bama taata bashikale). Nkukambo ako mulapalula mwaana musankwa mu buzuba bwa Nsabata. <verse eid="JHN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23" />Ono naa mwaana musankwa inga wapalulwa mubuzuba bwa Nsabata kwaamba ati mulawo wa Mozesi utatyolwi, Ino nkambo nzhi mulabwekela ndime mukuponya mubili wa muntu mubuzuba bwa Nsabata? <verse eid="JHN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24" />Mutabeteki chakulanga a menso, pesi amubeteka cha mashimpe.”<verse eid="JHN 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Saa uyu ngu Mesiya?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25" />Ono bantu bamwi baku Jelusalema bakatalika kubuzha ati, “Saa uyu taashi ngu muntu ngubayanda kujaya? <verse eid="JHN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26" />Kamubona ngoyu! Utokwaamba chaatangalala, alimwi tabatokwaamba ijwi kulinguwe. Saa bendelezhi bamanizha kale kwaamba uyu ngu Mesiya? <verse eid="JHN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27" />Pesi tulizhi uyu muntu nkwazwa, abobo Mesiya aakuza, taaku eshi akazhibe nkweshi akazwile.”<verse eid="JHN 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28" />Ono Jesu nakachili kuiisha mulubanza lwa tempele, wakoongolola ati, “Eye, mulinzhi, alimwi mulizhi nkundakazwa. Nshili waano anguzu zhangu, pesi wakantuma walo mukashimpe. Tamumuzhi akumuzhi, <verse eid="JHN 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29" />Pesi ime ndimuzhi nkambo ndakazwa kuli nguwe alimwi nguwakantuma ime.”<verse eid="JHN 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30" />Ono bantu bakalinga kuyanda kumujata, Pesi taaku wakabika lyaanza alinguwe, nkambo chiindi chamujata kachitana kushika. <verse eid="JHN 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31" />Mukati kambunga baanji bakashoma, bakaamba ati, “Naa Mesiya akushika, saa ulakuchita zhitondezho kwiinda uyu muntu?”<verse eid="JHN 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bashikulindilila mbubakatumwa kumujata Jesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32" />Ono bama Faliisi bakanva mbunga kabatepeta zhintu izhi alinguwe. Amana bapaizhi banene aba Faliisi bakatuma balindilili ba tempele kwaamba bamujate Jesu. <verse eid="JHN 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33" />Jesu wakaamba ati, ndi andimwe kwakaindi kashoonto, alimwi ndakuunka kuli oyo wakantuma. <verse eid="JHN 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34" />Mulaakunagaula, pesi tamukanjani, alimwi nkumbele, inga tamuzi.”<verse eid="JHN 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35" />Amana bama Juuda bakatalika kubuzhanya mulwabo ati, “Ino muntu uyu ulaanda kuunka kuli nkututakonzhi kumujana? Saa ulaanda kunka kuli abo besu bamwaikile akati kaba Giliki, alimwi akuiisha ba Giliki? <verse eid="JHN 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36" />Ino chilaamba zhi ono nakamba ati, mulakunangaula, pesi tamukajani, alimwi nkumbele, inga tamuzi?”<verse eid="JHN 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kasensa kapa maanzhi a buumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37" />Mubuzuba bunene bwa pobwe bwamamanino, Jesu wakaimikana alimwi akoongolola a lizwi linene waamba ati, kufumbwa ufile nyotwa, aze kulindime anwe. <verse eid="JHN 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38" />Alimwi kufumbwa ushoma ndime, mbuli malembe mbwaamba ati, ‘Tulonga twa maanzhi apa buumi tulakukunka kuzwa mulinguwe.”<verse eid="JHN 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39" />Kuzwa kuchechi wakalikwaamba Muuya, uyo abo bakalinga kushoma mulinguwe mbweshi bakatambule. Kuzwa ku chiindi icho Muuya kautana kupegwa, nkambo Jesu katana kulemekwa.<verse eid="JHN 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwandaana akati ka bantu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40" />Bamwi bantu nibakanva majwi akwe aaya bakaamba ati, “Nchachobeni, uyo muntu Mushinshimi.”<verse eid="JHN 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41" />Bamwi bakalinga kwaamba ati, “Ngu Mesiya!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 7:41">Alimwi bamwi kabaamba ati, “Ino Mesiya inga wazwa buti ku Galilii! <verse eid="JHN 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42" />Malembe alaamba ati, Mesiya ulakuzwa kumukowa wa Devedi ku Betelehemu, mumunzhi mwakalinga kukkala Mwami Devedi.” <verse eid="JHN 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43" />Abobo bakapansaana ankambo ka Jesu. <verse eid="JHN 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44" />Bamwi bakayanda kumujata, pesi taaku wakamujata.<verse eid="JHN 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutashoma kwa bama sololi bama Juuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45" />Ono kumamanino balindili ba tempele bakajokela kuba paizhi banene baba Falisi nibakashika uko, wakababuzha kwaamba ati, “Ino mwamushiila nzhi?”<verse eid="JHN 7:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46" />Balindili bantolongo bakanviila ati, “Taaku wiinga waamba mbuli mbwaamba uyu muntu!”<verse eid="JHN 7:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47" />Ba Faliisi bakabuzha ati, “Saa andimwe mulaamba ati wamuchenga?” <verse eid="JHN 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48" />Saa kuli beendelezhi naa ba Faliisi bakashoma muli nguwe? <verse eid="JHN 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49" />Taaku pesi batazhi milawo ya Mozesi, balichite lituko kuli Leza!”<verse eid="JHN 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50" />Ono Nikodimasi, umwi waba Faliisi wakaunka kuli Jesu mu mazuba akaindi wakabuzha ati, <verse eid="JHN 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51" />“Saa mulawo wesu ulatuzumizha kupa mulandu muntu kamutana kunva icho nchakachita.”<verse eid="JHN 7:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52" />Balo bakamunviila ati, “Saa ulazwila ku Galili andiwe? Kolanga muli nchicho, mulajana kwaamba mushinshimi tazwili ku Galili.”<verse eid="JHN 7:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53" />[Abobo boonse bakamwaika akuunka kumuzhaabo.]<verse eid="JHN 7:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8" />
  <para style="s">Mukaintu wakajatwa muchimambe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1" />Ono Jesu wakaunka ku chilundu cha Oliva. <verse eid="JHN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2" />Buzuba bwakachilila kuseni seni wakauka ku chipaililo. Bantu boonse bakamubunganina, akumuzhunguluka, amane wakakkala anshi akutalika kubaiisha boonse. <verse eid="JHN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3" />Bamane ba maii ba mulawo aba Faliisi bakamuletela mukaintu umwi wakajatwa chimambe. Bakamwimika akati. <verse eid="JHN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4" />Bakambila Jesu ati, “Omuii, mukaintu uyu wajatwa chimambe. <verse eid="JHN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5" />Mu mulawo wa Mosesi ulalailila ati aumwe mabwe mukaintu uyo. Ino iwe ulaamba nzhi?” <verse eid="JHN 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6" />Mukumubuzha ubo bakalinga kumuteya kwaamba bamujanine kaambo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:6">Pesi Jesu wakakotama akutalika kulemba anshi. <verse eid="JHN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7" />Ono nibakazumanana kumubuzha, wakakotamuka akubaambila ati, “Utachite chinyonyono akati kanu ataangune kuwaala libwe ku mukaintu uyu.” <verse eid="JHN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8" />Amane wakakotama alimwi akulemba anshi. <verse eid="JHN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9" />Nibakanva bobu, bakatalika kuzwa omwi omwi akaunka kutalikila kubanene kwakashaala boo mukaintu uyo eenka kainvi kumpela kuli Jesu. <verse eid="JHN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10" />Jesu nakakotamuka, wakabuzha mukaintu uyu ati, “O mukaintu, balikuli? Saa taaku wakupa mulandu?”<verse eid="JHN 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11" />Taaku Omuii,” wakanviila mukaintu. Amane Jesu wakamwambila ati, “Andime inga nshikupi mulandu. Kounka, pesi utakabishi alimwi.”<verse eid="JHN 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu mumuni wanyika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12" />Ono Jesu nakaamba ba Faliisi ati, “Ndime mumuni wanyika,” wakaamba ati, “Mfumbwa unchilila ulakuba mumumuni wa buumi, alimwi takaendi mu mushiinzhe.” Pesi ulakuba amumuni wa buumi. <verse eid="JHN 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13" />Ono mukambo kaka ba Faliisi bakamubuzha baamba, ono mbuli mbulyaambilila umwiine, bumboni bwako taaku nchibwaamba.<verse eid="JHN 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14" />Jesu wakanviila ati, “Nakuba kwaamba ndalyambilila ndimwiine, bumboni bwangu mbwachobeni, nkambo ime ndizhi nkundakazwila akuntekuunka. Pesi imwe tamuzhi nkundakazwila akuntekunka. <verse eid="JHN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15" />Imwe mulabeteka abuntu bwanu, Pesi ime nshibeteki muntu naba omwi. <verse eid="JHN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16" />Pesi nadabeteka, kusala kwangu nkwa kashimpe, nkambo nshili neenka, ndi a Taata uyo wakantuma. <verse eid="JHN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17" />Mu milawo yanu kulilembelwe kwaamba bumboni bwa bantu bobilo mbwa kashimpe. <verse eid="JHN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18" />Ndime ndyambilila bumboni ndimwiine, alimwi kamboni umwi ngu Taata uyo wakantuma.”<verse eid="JHN 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19" />Bamane bakamubuzha ati, “Ino Baiso bali kuli?” Jesu wakanviila ati,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:19">“Tamunzhi abalo ba Taa tamubazhi,” “Nimwalikunzhi niinga aba Taa kamubazhi.”<verse eid="JHN 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20" />Jesu wakaamba aya mazwi nakalinga kuiisha mulubaanza lwa tempele kufaafi abusena kwakalikubikilwe mulumbo. Alimwi taaku wakamujata nkambo chiindi chakwe kachitana kushika.<verse eid="JHN 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu waamba alufu lwakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21" />Alimwi Jesu wakabaambila ati, “Ntokuzwa wo, alimwi mulakunangaula, alimwi mulakufila muzhinyonyono zhanu. Nkunshi ngunke, tamukonzhi kuza.” <verse eid="JHN 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22" />Ono ba Juuda bakatalika kubuzha buzha kwaamba ati, “Saa ulaanda kulijaya? ‘Nkunja tamukonzhi kushika.’ ” <verse eid="JHN 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23" />Amane Jesu wakaabambila ati, “Imwe muli ba aanshi ano Ime ndi waku julu. Imwe muli banyika iyi, ime nshili wanyika iyi. <verse eid="JHN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24" />Nchidamwaambilila kwaamba mulaakufa muzhinyonyono zhanu naa tamushomi kwaamba ati, “Ndime Nguyo Uyo.’”<verse eid="JHN 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25" />Bakabuzha ati, “Ino ndiweni?” Jesu wakanviila ati, “Bweenka mbundakaamwambila kuzwa kumatalikilo. <verse eid="JHN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26" />Ndichite zhintu zhiinji zhakumwaambila, akumubeteka. Pesi uyo wakantuma ulashomeka, alimwi nchindakanva kulinguwe ndaambila nyika.” <verse eid="JHN 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27" />Balo taaku bakanvisha kwaamba wakalikubaambila ali Baishi. <verse eid="JHN 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28" />Amane Jesu wakaamba ati, “Mwaakusumpula Mwana a Muntu, mulakuzhiba kwaamba ndime nguwe, nshilichitili zhintu ndimwiine, pesi ndaamba makani bweenka mbwakanjiisha Taata. <verse eid="JHN 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29" />Uyo wakantuma uli andime, taaku nakanshiya neenka, nkambo lyoonse ndachita zhintu nzhayanda.” <verse eid="JHN 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30" />Naakali kwaamba makani aaya bantu baanji bakamushoma.<verse eid="JHN 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu waiisha zha kashimpe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31" />Ono Jesu wakaambila ba Juuda abo bakamushoma ati, “Naa munchilile kunjiisho zhangu, kashimpe mulaba bashichiiya bangu, <verse eid="JHN 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32" />amana mulaakuzhiba kashimpe alimwi kashimpe kalakumwaangulula.” <verse eid="JHN 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33" />Bakamunviila ati, “Tuli lunyungu lwa Abulahamu alimwi tatuna kubako kale bazhike. Ino inga mwaamba buti kwaamba ati, ‘Tulakwaangululwa’” <verse eid="JHN 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34" />Jesu wakanviila ati, “Kashimpe ndamwambila mfumbwa ubisha ngumuzhike ku chinyonyono. <verse eid="JHN 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35" />Abobo muzhike tachite busena bwakukkalilila mu mukwashi. Pesi Mwaana ulakkalilila kukabe kutamani. <verse eid="JHN 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36" />Naa Mwaana wamwangulula, nkukuti mwangululwa chanchobeni. <verse eid="JHN 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37" />Ndizhi kwaamba muli lunyungu lwa Abulahamu, pesi mulalangaula nzhila ya kwaamba munjaile mo, nkambo majwi angu abula busena mu myoyo yanu. <verse eid="JHN 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38" />Ndamwaambila nchindakabona mubushu bwaba Taa, alimwi mulachita nchimwakanva kuzwa kuli ishi wanu. <verse eid="JHN 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39" />Balo bakanviila ati, “Abulahamu ngu ishi wesu. Jesu nakanviila ati, “Nimwalinga bana Abulahamu,” “Anu inga mwachita zhintu nzhakachita Abulahamu. <verse eid="JHN 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40" />Mbuli mbuchibele mulalangaula nzhila yakunjaila mo, ime nindakamwaambila makani akashimpe ngundakanva kuzwa kuli Leza. Abulahamu taaku nakachita zhintu zhabobu. <verse eid="JHN 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41" />Mulachita milimo yakachita baiso.” Abalo bakamwaambila ati.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:41">“Tabushi baana bakazhalwa mu chimambe,” Tuli chite boo Taata omwi walo uli ngu Leza.” <verse eid="JHN 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42" />Jesu wakabaambila ati, “Naa Leza wakalinga ishi wanu, nimwakanyanda, nkambo ndazwa kuli nguwe. Nshinakulizila, Leza nguwakantuma. <verse eid="JHN 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43" />Ino nkambo nzhi tamuteleli nzhigaamba? Nkambo tamuzumini nzhingamba. <verse eid="JHN 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44" />Mulazulilwa kuli ishiwanu Satani, alimwi mulaanda kuchita kuyanda kwa ishiwanu nchayanda. Kuzwa kumatalikilo wakalinga mujayi, utazumini kashimpe, nkambo mulinguwe taamu kashimpe. Naa wabeja, ulaamba mushobo wakwe, nkambo ngu mubeji alimwi ngu ishi wababeji. <verse eid="JHN 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45" />Ono nkambo ndaamba kashimpe, tamunshoomi. <verse eid="JHN 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46" />Nguni akati kanu ukonzha kujanina kaambo? Naa nkangamba kashimpe, ino tamutekunshomena nzhi? <verse eid="JHN 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47" />Muntu oonse wa Leza ulanva majwi a Leza. Pesi imwe nchimutanvili nkambo tamuli bantu ba Leza.”<verse eid="JHN 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu a Abulahamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48" />Ono Jesu bakamubuzha ati, “Saa taaku nitwakaamba kabotu nitwakaamba kwaamba uli mu Samaliya alimwi kwaamba mulindiwe muli muuya ubiibi?” <verse eid="JHN 8:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49" />Jesu wakanviila ati, “Nshichite muuya ubiibi, “Ndalemeka Taata, pesi imwe tamundemeki. <verse eid="JHN 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50" />Nshililumbaizhi ndimwiine. Pesi nkwali umwi ululangaula, uyo ngweshi akamubeteke mulubazu lyangu. <verse eid="JHN 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51" />Kashimpe ndamwambila kwaamba, mfumbwa uchilila majwi ngushi akabule kubona lufu.” <verse eid="JHN 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52" />Ono kumakani aya, bakaamba ati, “Ono twazhiba kwaamba ulinjililwe muuya ubiibi! Abulahamu wakafa alimwi abashinshimi bakafa, ono iwe ulaamba kwaamba kufumbwa uchilila njiisho zhako takalusoli lufu. <verse eid="JHN 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53" />Saa iwe uli munene kwiinda ishi wesu Abulahamu? Wakafa alimwi abashinshimi bakafa? Ino iwe ulayeeya kwaamba nduwe nii? <verse eid="JHN 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54" />Jesu wakanviila ati, “Naa ndalilemya, bulemu bwangu mbwabuyo. Taata wangu uyo ngumwaamba ati ngu Leza wanu, ngumpa bulemu. <verse eid="JHN 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55" />Nakuba kwaamba imwe tamuna kumuzhiba, ime ndimuzhi, nindakaamba ati nshimuzhi nidakabeja mbuli ndimwe, pesi ndimuzhi alimwi ndachilila majwi akwe. <verse eid="JHN 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56" />Ono ishi wanu Abulahamu wakakomana kuyeya kubona buzuba bwangu, wakabubona alimwi wakasekelela.” <verse eid="JHN 8:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57" />Tonakushika a myaaka makkumi osanwe, bakamwambila ati, “Alimwi inga waamba ati wamubona Abulahamu?” <verse eid="JHN 8:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58" />Jesu wakanviila ati, “Nchanchobeni ndakwaambila ati, “Abulahamu katanakuzhalwa, ime ndakalinga ko kale’” <verse eid="JHN 8:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59" />Ono nkambo kachechi, bakabweza mabwe akumuwaala, pesi Jesu wakabayuba akuzwa mu tempele.<verse eid="JHN 8:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9" />
  <para style="s">Jesu wa kaponya muntu wa kazhalwa kali Moofu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1" />Jesu nakalinga kweenda wakabona musankwa wakazhalwa kali moofu. <verse eid="JHN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2" />Bashichiiya bakwe bakamubuzha ati, “Omuii, nchinyonyono chabaani chakapa kwaamba azhalwe kali moofu? chaakwe mwiine naa nchabazhali bakwe?” <verse eid="JHN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3" />Jesu wakanviila ati, “Tazhishi zhinyonyono zha muntu uyu, naa zhabazhali bakwe, abobo chakachitika bobu kwaamba nguzu zha Leza zhibonwe kwiinda mulinguwe. <verse eid="JHN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4" />Ono nakachili malumwi tulyeelele kusebenza nchito ya oyo wakantuma, nkambo mashiku alaza muntu ngatakonzhi kusebenza. <verse eid="JHN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5" />Kanchili munyika, ndi mumuni wanyika.” <verse eid="JHN 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6" />Nakamana kwaamba boobu, wakashipa mate anshi, akukanda bulongo angayo, wakananika moofu uyo mu meenso. <verse eid="JHN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7" />Wakamwaambila ati, “Kounka ukasambe mukazhiba ka Silomu.” (ili liina lilaamba kwaamba, “Kutumwa.”) Amane musankwa wakaunka wasamba, alimwi wakajoka kalanga.<verse eid="JHN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8" />Ono bashimukobonyina ababo bakalikumubona kalomba bakaamba ati, “Saa uyu taashi wakalinga kukkala kalombelela?” <verse eid="JHN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9" />Bamwi bakaamba ati, “Ngunguwe,”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:9">Bamwi bakaamba ati, “Taaku, ulakonzhana boo anguwe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:9">Pesi walo mwiine wakaamba ati, “Ndime muntu uyo.” <verse eid="JHN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10" />Bakamubuzha ati, “Ino meenso ako akabona buti?” <verse eid="JHN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11" />Wakabanviila ati, “Muntu wiitwa ati Jesu, nguwakanda bulongo akunanika mu meenso. Wangambila ati, kounka kukazhiba ka Siloamu usambe. Amana ndaunka ndasamba. Peenka awo ndachikonzha akulanga.” <verse eid="JHN 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12" />Bakamubuzha ati, “Ino uli kuli uyo muntu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:12">Wakanviila ati, “Nshizhi nkwabele.”<verse eid="JHN 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ba Faliisi mbubakavuntausha kuponeshegwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13" />Bakamuleta kuba Faliisi muntu uyo wakalinga moofu. <verse eid="JHN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14" />Ono mwakalinga mu buzuba bwa Nsabata Jesu nakakanda bulongo kwaamba ajalule menso a muntu uyo. <verse eid="JHN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15" />Ba Faliisi bakamubuzha alimwi ati, “Ino wabona buti?” Wakabaambila ati, “Wakananika bulongo mu menso angu, alimwi ndakaunka mukusamba, amana ono ndachikonzha kubona.”<verse eid="JHN 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16" />Bamwi ba Faliisi bakaamba ati, “Uyu muntu tazwi kuli Leza, Talemeki mulawo wa Nsabata.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:16">Bamwi bakabuzha ati, “Mbuti muntu mubishi mbwiinga wachita zhitondezho zhili mbuli bwazhezhi?” Amane bakandaana mulwabo.<verse eid="JHN 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17" />Bamane bama Faliisi bakamubuzha alimwi ati, “Waamba ati wakakuponya ku boofu bwako, nchibotu, Ino ulaamba nzhi alinguwe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:17">Muntu wakanviila ati, “Ngumushinshimi.”<verse eid="JHN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18" />Alimwi kabatana kushoma kwaamba wakalinga moofu akwaamba wakatalika kubona, kushikila bakatumya mulomo kubazhali bakwe kubaiita. <verse eid="JHN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19" />Bakabuzha ati, “Saa uyu ngu mwana anu? Saa ngunguwe ngu mwamba ati wakazhalwa kali moofu? Ina chilibuti kwaamba ono wabona?”<verse eid="JHN 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20" />Bazhali bakwe bakanviila ati, “Tulizhi kwaamba ngu mwanaeesu, “Alimwi tulizhi kwaamba wakazhalwa kali moofu. <verse eid="JHN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21" />Tatuzhi Pesi ono mbwabona, naa wamujalula meenso. Amumubuzhe ngumunene, ulalyambilila mwiine!” <verse eid="JHN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22" />Bazhali bakwe bakaamba bobu nkambo bakalikutija bama Sololi baba Juuda, nkambo balo bakalinga kuchite kale muzeezo wakwaamba eshi ambe ati Jesu ngu Mesiya ulaakugushigwa mu sinagogo. <verse eid="JHN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23" />Nchichecho bazhali bakwe nchibakaambila ati, “Ngu munene, kamumubuzha!” <verse eid="JHN 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24" />Alimwi lwabili bakamwiita muntu uyu wakazhalwa kaali moofu, bamane bakamwaambila ati, “Shomezha kuli Leza kwaamba ulaamba chanchobeni! Tulizhi kwaamba muntu uyu wakakuponya ngu shizhinyonyono.”<verse eid="JHN 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25" />Wakanviila ati, “Nshizhi naa ngushizhinyonyono naa taashi, “Nchinzhi boo nchakwaamba. Ndakalinga moofu, alimwi ono ndabona.”<verse eid="JHN 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26" />Bakamubuzha ati, “Ino nchinzhi nchakuchitila?” Ino mbuti mbwakakuponya ku boofu bwako?” <verse eid="JHN 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27" />Wakabanviila ati, “Ndamwaambila kale, alimwi tmunakunva. Ino mulayandila nzhi kunva alimwi? Saa andimwe mulayanda kuba bashichiiya bakwe?”<verse eid="JHN 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28" />Bamane bakatalika kumutukana, alimwi bakaamba ati, “Ulishichiiya wakwe! Pesi tuli bashichiiya ba Mozesi. <verse eid="JHN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29" />Tulizhi kwaamba Leza wakalinga kwaamba kwiinda muli Mozesi, pesi uyu muntu tatuzhi ankwazwila!”<verse eid="JHN 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30" />Ono uyu Muntu wakabanviila ati, “Ichi chintu chaba cheenzu! Tamumuzhi ankwazwila, pesi wakanponya boofu bwaangu! <verse eid="JHN 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31" />Tulizhi kwaamba Leza tanvili bashizhinyonyono, ulanva boo uyo umukomba akuchita nzhayanda. <verse eid="JHN 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32" />Taaku wakanva kokale kujalula menso muntu wakazhalwa kali moofu. <verse eid="JHN 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33" />Muntu uyu natalinga kuzwa kwa Leza, niinga taaku nchachita.”<verse eid="JHN 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34" />Bakanviila ati, “Kuzwa mukuzhalwa kwako wakazhalilwa mu chinyonyono, ino mbuti mbutuiisha?” Alimwi bakamusowela ansengwe a singagogo.<verse eid="JHN 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Boofu mu Muuya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35" />Jesu nakanva kwaamba bamusowela ansengwe, alimwi nakamujana wakaamba ati, “Saa ulashoma mu Mwana a Muntu?” <verse eid="JHN 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36" />Muntu wakabuzha ati, “Ngambile Omuii ino nguni, kwaamba andime nshome mulinguwe!” <verse eid="JHN 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37" />Jesu wakamwaambila ati, wamubona, alimwi, ngunguwe ngu ntokwaamba anguye ono.”<verse eid="JHN 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38" />Amane muntu wakaamba ati, “Mwami, ndashoma!” Amane wakakomba Jesu.<verse eid="JHN 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39" />Amana Jesu wakaamba ati, ndakazila kubeteka nyika, kwaamba abo bataboni babone, alimwi abo babona bofaale.<verse eid="JHN 9:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40" />Ono bamwi ba Faliisi bakalinga anguwe bakanva makani aya, bakamubuzha ati, “Inzhi? Saa andiswe tuli boofu?”<verse eid="JHN 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41" />Jesu wakaamba ati, “Nimwalinga boofu, niinga tamuchite mulandu, pesi ono mbumulyaamba kwaamba tulalanga, ulanokuli mulandu wanu.”<verse eid="JHN 9:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10" />
  <para style="s">Jesu ngu mweembezhi mubotu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1" />Ono Jesu wakaamba ati, “Nchanchobeni ndamwambila uyo utanjilili kunjilila mbelele, pesi katantila kumbi, ngu kabwalala alimwi mubbi. <verse eid="JHN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2" />Ono uyo unjilila kumulyango ngu mweembezhi wambelele. <verse eid="JHN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3" />Mulindizhi wamulyango ulamujalwila mulyango mweembezhi, alimwi mbelele zhilalinva lizwi lya mweembezhi. Ula zhiita mbelele zhakwe amaiina akuzhisololela ku machelelo. <verse eid="JHN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4" />Amana kuzhigusha zhoonse. Ulazhisololela kumpela, alimwi mbelele zhilamuchilila nkambo zhililizhi lizwi lyakwe. <verse eid="JHN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5" />Pesi taaku nizhiyakuchilila mweenzu, alimwi inga zhamubalika nkambo tazhilizhi lizwi lya mweenzu.”<verse eid="JHN 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6" />Jesu wakasebenzha kaambyo aka, pesi ba Faliisi taaku bakanvisha nchakalinga kubaambila.<verse eid="JHN 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu ngu mweembeli mubotu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7" />Abobo, Jesu wakaamba alimwi ati, “Nchanchobeni ndamwaambila, ime ndime mulyango wambelele. <verse eid="JHN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8" />Boonse bakaza nshitana kuza, mbakabwalala alimwi mbabbi, pesi mbelele taaku nizhakabanvila. <verse eid="JHN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9" />Ndime mulyango, mfumbwa unjila muli ndime ulakufutulwa, balanakunjila a kuzwa, alimwi balakujana machelelo. <verse eid="JHN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10" />Kabwalala ulaza boo kubba a kujaya, Pesi ime ndakazila kwaamba babe a buumi, alimwi buumi buzwile.<verse eid="JHN 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11" />“Ndime mweembezhi mubotu. Mwembezhi mubotu ulafila mbelele zhakwe. <verse eid="JHN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12" />Musebenzhi taashi mwiine mbelele alimwi tazhishi zhaakwe. Ono naa wabona baumpe kabaza, ulazhishishiya mbelele a kubalika. Amana baumpe balatanda butanga alimwi zhilamwaikana. <verse eid="JHN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13" />Ono uyo muntu ulabalika nkambo ngumusebenzhi boo alimwi tabikili maano kumbelele. <verse eid="JHN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14" />“Ndi mweembezhi mubotu, ndizhizhi mbelele zhangu azhalo zhilinzhi. <verse eid="JHN 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15" />Bweenka ba Taata mbubanzhi, andime ndibazhi ba Taa. Alimwi ndazumina kufila mbelele. <verse eid="JHN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16" />Nkuzhili a zhimwi mbelele, zhitali zhamuchaanda ichi. Ndyeelele kuzhileta azhalo. Azhalo zhilakunva ku lizwi lyangu, alimwi zhilakuba butanga bomwi, amweembezhi omwi.<verse eid="JHN 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17" />Taata nchanyandila nkambo ndakazumizha buumi bwangu kwaamba mfe alimwi akubuka. <verse eid="JHN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18" />Taaku muntu ububweza buumi kuzwa kulindime, pesi ndakubutula ndimwiine. Ndichite nguzu zhakutula azhakubweza ndimwine. Aya ngu malailile ngundakapegwa a Taata.”<verse eid="JHN 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19" />Ono kwakaba kwandaana akati kaba Juuda nibakanva majwi aya. <verse eid="JHN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20" />Baanji bakaamba ati, “Uyu muntu ulinjililwe muuya ubiibi alimwi ulichinkukile. Ino nkambo nzhi mulamunvila?”<verse eid="JHN 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21" />Pesi bamwi bakaamba ati, “Uku takushi nkukwaamba kwa muntu unjililwe muuya ubiibi. Saa muuya ubiibi inga wajalula menso a moofu?”<verse eid="JHN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bama Juuda bamukaka Jesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22" />Ono chakalinga chiindi cha Pasika kuyeeya kumana kwakuyaka kwa Ng'anda ya Leza mu Jelusalema, alimwi wakalinga mupeo. <verse eid="JHN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23" />Ono Jesu wakalinga kwendenda mu lubaanza lwa tempele mumavuka akwe Solomoni. <verse eid="JHN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24" />Ono ba Juuda bakalinga wo bakamubunganina akumubuzha ati, “Ino tulakkala chiindi chilaamfu buti katulindila bwiinguzhi? Kotwaambila chantangalala, saa ndiwe Mesiya?” <verse eid="JHN 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25" />Jesu wakanviila ati, “Ndakamwambila kale, pesi tamushomi. Inchito nzhinchita mu liina lya Taata zhilapa bumboni bwangu, <verse eid="JHN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26" />Pesi tamushomi imwe nkambo tamushi mbelele zhangu. <verse eid="JHN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27" />Mbelele zhangu zhilanva ku jwi lyangu, andime ndizhizhi, azhalo zhilanchilila. <verse eid="JHN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28" />Ime ndazhipa buumi butamani. Tazhikafi, alimwi taaku wiinga wazhisompola. <verse eid="JHN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29" />Taata wakazhipa kulindime munene kwiinda boonse. Taaku wiinga wazhigusha kuzwa kumaanza aba Ta. <verse eid="JHN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30" />Ime a Taata tuli omwi.”<verse eid="JHN 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31" />Alimwi bama Juuda bakabweza mabwe kwaamba bamuwaale, <verse eid="JHN 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32" />pesi Jesu wakabaambila ati, “Ndakamutondezha inchito zhibotu zhiinji zhizwa kuli Taata. Ino njili ali zhezhi nzhimuyanda kungwaalila mabwe?”<verse eid="JHN 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33" />Bakanviila ati “Tatute kukuwaalila nchito ibotu, pesi nkambo kakasampusampu! Uli muntu boo iwe, pesi ulayaamba kuba Leza!”<verse eid="JHN 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34" />Jesu wakambanviila ati, “Saa tachilembelwe mu milawo yanu kwaamba ati, “Muli tu leza leza?’ <verse eid="JHN 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35" />Naa Leza wakabaita ati ntu leza leza bantu abo bakaamba majwi akwe. Nkukwaamba malembe nga mashimpe lyoonse. <verse eid="JHN 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36" />Ino kuli babo mbakabika ambali Taata mbuli baakwe alimwi akubatuma munyika? Ino nkambo nzhi mulampa kaambo kakusampula nkambo ndaamba ati, ‘Ndi Mwana a Leza? <verse eid="JHN 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37" />Mutanshomi chita nsebenze inchito ya Taata. <verse eid="JHN 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38" />Pesi naa ndachita, nimutashomi ime lwangu, amwishome inchito kwaamba mu chikonzhe kuzhiba akunvishisha kwaamba Taata uli muli ndime, andime ndi muli Taata.<verse eid="JHN 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39" />Ono alimwi bakasola kumujata, pesi wakabapuzhumuka.<verse eid="JHN 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40" />Ono Jesu wakaunka alimwi kutala a mulonga wa Jodani, kubusena uko Joni nkwakalinga kubbizhila kutaanguna, amane wakakkala, <verse eid="JHN 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41" />alimwi bantu baanji bakaza kulinguwe bakaamba ati, “Nakuba kwaamba Joni taaku nakachita chitondezho, pesi zhoonse nzhakaamba a muntu uyu nzha kashimpe.” <verse eid="JHN 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42" />Alimwi uko bantu baanji bakashoma muli Jesu.<verse eid="JHN 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11" />
  <para style="s">Lufu lwa Lazalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1" />Ono musankwa wa liina lya Lazalo wakalinga kuchiswa, wakalinga kukkala ku Betani, mumuzhi mwakalinga kukkala Maliya a Maata. <verse eid="JHN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2" />Uyu Maliya, mukwabo Lazalo wakalinga kuchiswa, ngu nguwe wakananika Mwami Jesu mafuta, akumupukuta a misusu kumyeendo yakwe. <verse eid="JHN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3" />Amane bakwabo bakaintu bobilo aba bakatumya mulomo kuli Jesu wakwaamban ati, “O Mwami, mwenzhinyoko ngoyandishisha ulachiswa.”<verse eid="JHN 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4" />Ono Jesu nakanva majwi aya wakamba ati, “Uku kuchiswa teshi kukutole ku lufu. Taaku, nkwa bulemu bwa Leza kwaamba Mwana Leza alumbaizhigwe kwiinda mulinkuko.”<verse eid="JHN 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5" />Ono Jesu wakalinga kubayanda ba Maata a Maliya a Lazalo mukwabo. <verse eid="JHN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6" />Ono nakanva ati Lazalo ulachiswa wakachilinga kushite kubusena uko kwamazuba amwi obilo. <verse eid="JHN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7" />Nakamana mazuba aya wakaambila bashichiiya bakwe ati, “Atujokele ku chishi cha Judiya.”<verse eid="JHN 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8" />Bashichiiya bakanviila ati, “Omuii, ” “Ono ono boo ba Juuda bakalinga kuyanda kukuuma mabwe, alimwi ulaanda kujokela?”<verse eid="JHN 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9" />Jesu wakanviila ati, “Tee buzuba bulichite maoola ali kkumi aobilo? Muntu weenda malumwi talifumpuli, nkambo uleenda lizuba kalibala. <verse eid="JHN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10" />Mashiku bantu nibalifumpula, nkambo taaku mumuni.” <verse eid="JHN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11" />Nakamana boo kwaamba, wakaunka mukwaaambila bashichiiya bakwe ati, “Mwenzhinyinesu Lazalo uloona, pesi ndaunka nkamubushe.”<verse eid="JHN 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12" />Bashichiiya bakanviila ati, “Mwami, naa uloona anu ulapona.”<verse eid="JHN 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13" />Ono Jesu wakalinga kwaamba koona kwa lufu, pesi balo bakalinga kuyeeya koona kwatulo. <verse eid="JHN 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14" />Amane Jesu wakaamba chantangalala ati, “Lazalo wafa, <verse eid="JHN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15" />pesi nkambo kandimwe ndakomana kwaamba nshindakalinga anguwe, kwaamba mukashome, atuunke kuliguwe.”<verse eid="JHN 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16" />Amane Tomasi, (wiitwa ati Mpuundu) wakaambila bashichiiya bamwi ati, “Atuunke andiswe kwaamba tukafe anguwe!”<verse eid="JHN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu ngu buumi a bubuke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17" />Ono chiindi Jesu nakashika, wakajana kwaamba kwakalinga kwiindile kale mazuba one Lazalo kazhikilwe. <verse eid="JHN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18" />Ono ku Betani kwakalinga afaafi aku Jelusalemu, wakalinga musinzo mufaafi boo (makilomita otatwe), <verse eid="JHN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19" />alimwi ba Juuda baanji bakaza kubayumyayumya ba Maata a Maliya akambo kalufu lwamukwabo.<verse eid="JHN 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20" />Maata nakanva ati Jesu washika, wakaunka kumuchiinzha, Maliya wakalinga kushite mu ng'anda. <verse eid="JHN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21" />Amane Maata wakaambila Jesu ati, “O Mwami, ati niwakalinga ko, mukwesu natakafa. <verse eid="JHN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22" />Pesi ndizhi kwaamba nakuba ono Leza ula kupa mfumbwa ncheshi ulombe.”<verse eid="JHN 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23" />Jesu wakamwaambila ati, “Mukwanu ulaakubuka alimwi.” <verse eid="JHN 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24" />Maata wakanviila ati, ndizhi ulakubuka alimwi mububuke bwabafu, mu buzuba bwamamanino.” <verse eid="JHN 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25" />Jesu wakamwaambila ati, “Ndime bubuke a buumi. Uyo ushoma mulindime ulakuba a buumi, nakuba kwaamba wafa, <verse eid="JHN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26" />alimwi awalo upona a kushoma mulindime, teshi akafe. Saa ulashoma ubo?”<verse eid="JHN 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27" />Wakanviila ati, “Eye, Mwami,” “Ndashoma kwaamba ndiwe Mesiya, Mwana a Leza, ushi akaze mu nyika muno.” <verse eid="JHN 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28" />Ono nakamana kwaamba ichi, Maata wakaunka kwiita Maliya ambali ati, “Muii uli wano, wakamwaambila ati, “Alimwi ulakuyanda.” <verse eid="JHN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29" />Maliya nakanva ichi, wakanyamuka kufambana alimwi wakaunka kuli nguwe. <verse eid="JHN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30" />(Ono Jesu katana kunjila mu munzhi, kachili kubusena nkubakaswanganina a Maata.) <verse eid="JHN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31" />Ono bama Juuda bakalinga a Maliya mu ng'anda kabamuyumyayumya, nibakabona mbwakanyamuka chalubilo akuzwila asengwe, bakamuchilila nkambo bakayeeya ati ulaunka ku chuumbwe mukulila.<verse eid="JHN 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32" />Ono Maliya nakashika kubusena uko kwakalinga Jesu, nakamubona, wakaliwaala ku myeendo a kwaamba ati, “Mwami, niwalinga ko, mukwesu natafa!”<verse eid="JHN 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33" />Jesu nakamubona kalila, wakapengekana maninji mu muuya alimwi a mu moyo. <verse eid="JHN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34" />Wakababuzha ati, “Ino nkuli ku chuumbwe nkumwamooneka?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:34">Bakanviila ati, “Koza ubone, Mwami.”<verse eid="JHN 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35" />Jesu wakalila. <verse eid="JHN 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36" />Amane bama Juuda bakaamba ati, “Amubone mbwalinga ku muyanda!”<verse eid="JHN 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37" />Pesi bamwi bakaamba ati, “Saa uyu taashi muntu wakajalula meenso moofu inga waleka muntu uyu kwaamba atafi?”<verse eid="JHN 11:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu wakabusha Lazalo kuzwa kubafu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38" />Jesu alimwi wakaba a nkuumbu, washika ku chuumbwe. Chakalinga libwe lya ka kololwa ku manjililo. <verse eid="JHN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39" />Jesu wakabaambila ati, “Amuligushe libwe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:39">Amane Maata, mukwabo a muntu wakafa, wakaambila Jesu ati, “O Mwami, chino chiindi ulanunka, nkambo ono kuliindile mazuba one kazhikilwe.”<verse eid="JHN 11:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40" />Jesu wakamunvila ati, “Saa nshina kukwaambila ati nakoshoma, ulakububona bulemu bwa Leza?” <verse eid="JHN 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41" />Amane libwe bakaligusha. Amane Jesu wakalungumana ku julu akwaamba ati, “Taata, ndakulumba nkambo kakwaamba wantalela. <verse eid="JHN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42" />Kwalo ndizhi kwaamba lyoonse ulantelela, pesi ndaamba a kaambo ka bantu aba bali waano kwaamba bashome ati ndiwe wakantuma. <verse eid="JHN 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43" />Nakamana boo kwaamba, wakoongolola ajwi linene akwaamba ati, “Lazalo, kozwa!” <verse eid="JHN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44" />Ono uyo muntu wakalinga kufile wakazwa, kabbutaililwe, ku myeendo akumaanza azhisani, alimwi achisani chimwi ku menso.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:44">Jesu wakabaambila ati, “Amumwangulule zhisani zhamuchuumbwe mumuleke aunke.”<verse eid="JHN 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bakakanza kujaya Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mateyo 26.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Maako 14.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luuka 22.1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45" />Abobo, ba Juuda baanji bakaswaya Maliya nibakabona chakachitika bakamushoma Jesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46" />Pesi bamwi babo bakaunka kwaambila ba Faliisi nchakachita. <verse eid="JHN 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47" />Amane ba paizhi banene aba Faliisi bakabungana muli chabo a kwaamba ati, “Ino tulachita buti? Ngoyu muntu ulachita zhitondezho zhiinji! <verse eid="JHN 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48" />Naa tumuleke aunke bweenka ubu, boonse balashoma mulinguwe, amana ba Looma balaakuza akunyonyoona tempele a chishi chesu!”<verse eid="JHN 11:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49" />Ono umwi wabo, waambwa ati Kaifasi, wakalinga mu paizhi munene mwaaka uyo, wakabaambila ati, “Muli bayozhi buti! <verse eid="JHN 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50" />Saa tamuyeeyi kwaamba nchibotu kwaamba muntu omwi afile bantu boonse kwiinda kwaamba chishi choonse shinyonyooke. <verse eid="JHN 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51" />Icho nchaakaamba takuchakazwa mulinguyo lwaakwe mwiine, pesi mbuli mupaizhi munene wa mwaaka uyo wakashinshima kwaamba Jesu ulakubafila ba Juuda, <verse eid="JHN 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52" />Kutaashi boo kufila mushobo uyu weenka, pesi kwaamba ulakuza akubunganya antomwi boonse bana ba Leza bamwaikila munyika yoonse.<verse eid="JHN 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53" />Ono kuzwa mu buzuba ubu bakakanza kumujaya. <verse eid="JHN 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54" />Abobo, Jesu taaku nakeenda chantangalala akati ka bantu baku Judiya, pesi wakazwako akauunka kunyika yakumbali a chimpayuma, ku munzhi wa Efulaimu. Uko nkwakaunka mu kukkala a bashichiiya bakwe.<verse eid="JHN 11:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55" />Ono Pasika ya ba Juuda kaliyanda kushiika, bantu baanji bakaza akuunka ku Jelusalema ku chiyanza chakusalazhigwa Pasika kaitana kuba. <verse eid="JHN 11:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56" />Bantu bakazumanana kumulangaula Jesu, akubuzhanya buzhanya nibakali kwiinvi mu lubaanza lwa tempele. “Mulayeeya buti? Saa aze ku Pobwe?” <verse eid="JHN 11:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57" />Pesi bapaizhi banene alimwi aba Faliisi bakalailila bantu boonse kwaamba mfumbwa eshi akamubone Jesu akabambile kuchita kwaamba bakamwaange.<verse eid="JHN 11:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12" />
  <para style="s">Jesu wakananikwa mafuta ku Betani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mateyo 26.6-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Maako 14.3-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1" />Nikwakashaala mazuba ali chisambomwe kwaamba pobwe lya Pasika libe, Jesu wakashika ku munzhi waku Betani uko Lazalo nkwakalinga kukkala uyo ngwakabusha kuzwa kubafu. <verse eid="JHN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2" />Ono bakamujikila chakulya chakumangolezha, Maata nguwakalinga kubapa zhakulya. Awalo Lazalo wakalinga wo a bantu abo bakalinga kulya. <verse eid="JHN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3" />Maliya wakabweza Mafuta anunkila adula, wakatila Jesu ku myeendo amane wakamupukuta amisusu yakwe. ng'anda yoonse yakazula kununkila kwa Mafuta. <verse eid="JHN 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4" />Ono umwi shichiiya wa Jesu, Judasi Sikaliyoti, uyo wakali kuunka mu kwaaba Jesu, wakaamba ati, <verse eid="JHN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5" />“Ina nkambonzhi taaku nauzhigwa boo aya mafuta kwaamba maali twape bachete?” Muulo wa Mafuta nakauzhigwa wakalinga mbuli muulo wa maali muntu nganga wavola mwaaka omwi. <verse eid="JHN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6" />Taaku nakaamba ichi a kaambo ka kwaamba ati wakali kubayanda bachete, pesi nkambo ka kwaamba wakalinga kabwalala, mbuli mbwakalinga muntu wakali kuyobola choola cha maali, wakali kusebenzha mwiine mbuli mbwayanda.<verse eid="JHN 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7" />Ono Jesu wakaamba ati, “Muleke! “Amumuleke wabaamba mafuta aya kubuzuba bwangu bwakuzhikwa. <verse eid="JHN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8" />Bachete munoli ambabo lyoonse, pesi ime nshinoli andimwe lyoonse.”<verse eid="JHN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kukanza kwa kujatwa kwa Lazalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9" />Ono, mbunga ya ba Juuda yakazhiba kwaamba Jesu nkwaali alimwi bakaza, kutashibo nkambo kakwe pesi amukubona Lazalo, uyo ngwakabusha kuzwa kubafu. <verse eid="JHN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10" />Bamane banene baba paizhi bakatalika kukanza kumujaya Lazalo awalo, <verse eid="JHN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11" />a kaambo kakwe ba Juuda baanji bakalinga kuunka kuli Jesu akumushoma.<verse eid="JHN 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu waakanjila mu Jelusalema a bulemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mateyo 21.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Maako 11.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luuka 19.28-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12" />Ono buzuba bwakachilila mbunga ya bantu yakalingayaza ku pobwe lya Pasika bakanva ati Jesu ulazaku Jelusalema. <verse eid="JHN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13" />Bakabweza misaampi yamalala akuunka kumuchinzha, kabaya koolobezha ati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">“Hossana!”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:13">“Walelekwa uyo uza mu liina lya Mwami!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">Walelekwa Mwami waba Izilaili!”<verse eid="JHN 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14" />Ono Jesu nakajana mwana mbongolo wakakkala alinguwe, bweenka mbuli mbukulembelwe ati.<verse eid="JHN 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15" />“Utatiji o munzhi wa Ziyoni, kolanga</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:15">Mwami wako ulaza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:15">katantile a mwana ambongolo.”<verse eid="JHN 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16" />Kutaanguna bashichiiya bakwe taaku nibakazhinva izhi zhoonse, kushikila Jesu nakapegwa bulemu bakayeeya ati izhi zhintu zhakalikulembelwe alinguwe, alimwi akwaamba zhintu zhakachitilwa nguwe.<verse eid="JHN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17" />Ono mbunga yakalinga anguwe chiindi nakaita Lazalo kuzwa mu chuumbwe alimwi akumubusha kuzwa kubafu bakazumanana kumwaya makani. <verse eid="JHN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18" />Nkambo kachitondezho ichi nchibakanva nchakachita, bantu baanji bakaunka mukumuswaanganya. <verse eid="JHN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19" />Ono ba Faliisi bakatalika kwaamba kuli omwi a omwi, “Amubone, ichi taaku nkuchitekututola. Amulange nyika yoonse mbuyamuchilila!”<verse eid="JHN 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ba Giliki mbubakamulangaula Jesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20" />Ono kwakalinga ba Giliki akati kabo bakaunka mukumukomba ku Pobwe. <verse eid="JHN 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21" />Bakaza kuli Filipo, wakazwa ku munzhi wa Betesaida mu chishi cha Galilaya akumwaambila ati, “Omuii tulanda kubona Jesu.”<verse eid="JHN 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22" />Abobo Filipo wakaunka kwaambila Andulu makani aya, pesi Andulu wakaunka a Filipo mukwaambila Jesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23" />Jesu wakanviila ati, “Chindi chashika chakwaamba Mwana a Muntu apegwe bulemu. <verse eid="JHN 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24" />Nchanchobeni ndamwaambila, chita nsenke ya maila yalokela mubulongo alimwi yafa, inga kaishite lyoonse kaili boo yomwe. Pesi naa yafa, ilazhala zhimwi nseke zhiinji. <verse eid="JHN 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25" />Uyu uyandisha buumi bwakwe ulakubusowekelwa, pesi uyo utayandishi buumi bwakwe bwamunyika muno ulakuba a buumi butamani. <verse eid="JHN 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26" />Uyo oonse uyanda kusenbenzela anchilile, a nkumbele, amusebenzhi wangu nkwaelele kuba. Alimwi Taata ulakumulemeka uyo unsebenzela.<verse eid="JHN 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27" />“Ono moyo wangu wapenga, alimwi ndaamba nzhi? ‘Taata, nvune achiindi ichi?’ Taaku, nkukambo kako ndaza chiindi chino. <verse eid="JHN 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28" />Taata, “liina lyako lilemekwe.” Ono kwakanvigwa ijwi ku julu lyaamba ati, “Ndalilemeka, alimwi nda kulilemeka alimwi.”<verse eid="JHN 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29" />Ono imbunga ya bantu yakalinga ko alimwi niyakanva, yakaamba ati, yazuzuma, bamwi bakaamba ati, “Mungeli nguwaamba kulinguwe!” <verse eid="JHN 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30" />Jesu wakabaambila ati, “Ili jwi lyanvigwa nkambo kanu, kutaashi nkambo kangu. <verse eid="JHN 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31" />Ono chashika chiindi chakwaamba nyika ibetekwe, amana mweendelezhi wanyika iyi ulakushigwa. <verse eid="JHN 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32" />Alimwi ime, ndakusumpulwa kuzwa ku nyika, ndakuleta boonse bantu kulindime.” <verse eid="JHN 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33" />(Jesu wakaamba kutondezha mbulubele lufu ndweshi akafwe.)<verse eid="JHN 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34" />Imbunga ya bantu yakanviila ati, “Tee twakanva kuzwa ku mulawo kwaamba Mesiya ulakupona kukabe kutamani. Ino iwe ulaamba buti ati Mwana a Muntu ulyeelele kusumpulwa? Nguni Mwana a Muntu uyu?”<verse eid="JHN 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35" />Amane Jesu wakabaambila ati, “Mulaakuba a mumuni kwakaindi kashoonto. Amweende kamuchili mu mumuni, mishinzhe kautana kumushikila. mfumbwa weenda mu munshinzhe taboni nkwaunka. <verse eid="JHN 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36" />Ono nimuchili a mumuni, amushome mu mumuni kwaamba mube bana ba mumuni.”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 12:36">Kutashoma kwa bantu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:36">Jesu nakamana kwaamba makani aaya, wakaunka wakakulisisa kuzwa kuli mbabo.<verse eid="JHN 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37" />Nakuba kwaamba Jesu wakachita zhitondezho zhiinji mumenso aabo, taaku nibakashoma. <verse eid="JHN 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38" />Ichi chakachitika kuzuzikizha ijwi lya mushinshimi Izaya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">“O Mwami, ino mbaani bakashoma mulumbe wesu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:38">alimwi nguzu zha Mwami zhakazubululwa kuli bani?”<verse eid="JHN 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39" />A kaambo aka taaku nibakashoma, nkambo, mbuli Izaya mbwamba mumwi ati,<verse eid="JHN 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40" />“Leza</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">ofaazha meenso abo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">alimwi wayumya myoyo yabo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">abobo tabacikonzhi kubona a meenso abo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">naa kunvisha a myoyo yabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">nakuba kusandukila kulindime kwaamba mbaponye.”<verse eid="JHN 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41" />Izaya wakaamba bobo nkambo wakabona bulemu bwa Jesu, alimwi akwaamba ali nguwe.<verse eid="JHN 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42" />Pesi a chiindi cheenka bamasololi baanji bakashoma mulinguwe. Pesi nkambo kaba Falisi takubakaamba lushomo lwabo antangalala a kaambo kakutija kutandwa mu sinagogo. <verse eid="JHN 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43" />Nkambo bakali kuyanda kulumbaizhigwa kuzwa ku bantu kwiinda kuzwa kuli Leza.<verse eid="JHN 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lubeta lwa majwi a Jesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44" />Amane Jesu wakaoolobezha ati, “Uyo ushoma muli ndime tashomi boo ndime neenka, Pesi ulashoma a muli uyo wakantuma. <verse eid="JHN 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45" />Alimwi mfumbwa muntu ubona ndime wabona oyo wakantuma. <verse eid="JHN 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46" />Ndakaza munyika kuba mumumi muli njiyo, kwaamba kufumbwa ushoma muli ndime atakkali mu mushinzhe. <verse eid="JHN 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47" />Kufumbwa unva majwi angu amana katabaambi, nshimubeteki uyo muntu, nkambo taaku ndakazila kubeteka nyika, pesi kufutula nyika. <verse eid="JHN 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48" />Kuli mubeteshi ku oyo utatambuli majwi angu, ulichite mubeteshi. Majwi eenka ngundakaambilizha alakumupa chisubulo mu buzuba bwamamanino. <verse eid="JHN 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49" />Nkambo taaku ndakaamba majwi mu nguzu zhangu ndimwiine. Taata wakantuma nguwakapa malailile azhinjelele kwaamba. <verse eid="JHN 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50" />Abobo ndizhi ati malailile akwe alatola ku buumi butamani. Abobo mfumbwa nzhingaamba ndazhaamba nkambo Taata wakangaambila kuzhaamba.”<verse eid="JHN 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13" />
  <para style="s">Jesu wakasanzha myeendo ya bashichiiya bakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1" />Ono chiindi cha pobwe lya Pasika, kachitana kushika Jesu wakazhiba kwaamba chiindi chakwe chakuzwa mu nyika muno akuunka kuli Baishi chakalinga afaafi. Mbuli mbwakayandishisha boo bakwe bakalinga mu nyika, wakabayanda kushika kumamanino.<verse eid="JHN 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2" />Jesu a bashichiiya bakwe nibakalinga kulya mangolezha, Judasi mwana Simoni Sikalyoti wakanjilwa Satani mu moyo, kwaamba ba mwaabe Jesu. <verse eid="JHN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3" />Jesu wakalikuzhi kwaamba ati Baishi bakabika zhintu zhoonse mu maanza akwe, wakalikuzhi a kwaamba wakazwa kuli Leza a kwaamba ulakujokela kuli Leza, <verse eid="JHN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4" />Wakanyamuka nakali kulalila, wakafuula chibaki chakwe, alimwi wakaanga chitaaulu mu chibuno. <verse eid="JHN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5" />Ono nakamana, wakatila maanzhi mumbale akutalika kusanzha bashichiiya bakwe ku myeendo, akubapukuta achitaaulu ichi. <verse eid="JHN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6" />Ono nakashika kuli Saimoni Petulo, wakamwaambila ati, “Mwami, saa ndiwe welele kunsanzha ku myeendo?” <verse eid="JHN 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7" />Jesu wakamwaambila ati, “Tochizhi nchinchita, pesi munshi akoku ulakukonzha kuchinva nchichaamba.”<verse eid="JHN 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8" />Pesi Petulo wakaamba ati, “Teshi unsanzhe myeendo!” Jesu wakanviila ati, “Naa ntakusanzhi teshi ube alubazu kulindime.”<verse eid="JHN 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9" />Simoni Petulo wakanviila ati, “Mwami, utasaanzhi boo kumyeendo pesi aku maanza akumutwi koonse!”<verse eid="JHN 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10" />Jesu wakanviila ati, “Abo basamba kale amubili balyelele kusamba boo kumyeendo, mubili wabo oonse ulasalala. Alimwi ulasalala, nakuba tamushi noonse.” <verse eid="JHN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11" />Nkambo wakalikumuzhi uyo eshi akamwaabe, alimwi nchakambila kwaamba tamushi noonse nimusalala.<verse eid="JHN 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12" />Ono Jesu nakamana kubasanzha ku myeendo, wakasama zhisani zhakwe akujokela mpakalinga kushite. Wakababuzha ati, “Saa mwachinva nchindachita kulindimwe?” <verse eid="JHN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13" />Mulanjita ati, ‘Muii’ alimwi Mwami, alimwi muli boo kabotu nkambo ubo mbumbele. <verse eid="JHN 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14" />Naa ime, ndi Mwami a Muii wanu, ndamusazha myeendo, andimwe mulyeelele kusazhanya kuli omwi a omwi ku myeendo. <verse eid="JHN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15" />Ndamupa mukonzhano kwaamba kamuchita bweenka mbundachita. <verse eid="JHN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16" />Nchanchobeni ndamwaambila, taaku muzhike wiinda shimalelo akwe, awalo shikutumwa talimunene kwiinda uyo wakamutuma. <verse eid="JHN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17" />Ono nkambo mwazhizhiba izhi zhintu, mulakulelekwa mwakuzhichita.<verse eid="JHN 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18" />Nshaambi ndimwe noonse, pesi ndibazhi abo mbundakasala. Pesi uku nkuzuzikizha mpango ya malembe aamba ati. ‘Uyo ngundya anguwe mbale yomwi wambukila.’ <verse eid="JHN 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19" />Ndamwaambila ono kachitana kuchitika kwaamba chakuchitika mukashome kwaamba ‘Ndime nguwe.’ <verse eid="JHN 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20" />Nchachobeni ndamwaambila ati, mfumbwa utambula ngundakatuma ulatambula wakantuma alimwi mfumbwa untambula watambula wakantuma.”<verse eid="JHN 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu wakaamba ati Judasi ngweshi a mwaabe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:20-25">Mateyo 26.20-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:17-21">Maako 14.17-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">Luuka 22.21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21" />Nakamana kwaamba chechi, Jesu wakapengana mu moyo akupa bumboni bwakwaamba ati, “Nchanchobeni ndamwaambila, umwi wanu ulangaba.”<verse eid="JHN 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22" />Amana bashichiiya bakatalika kulanganalangana kuli omwi a omwi, kabatazhi naa nguni uyo ngwaamba. <verse eid="JHN 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23" />Ono umwi wabashichiiya bakwe, Jesu ngwakali kuyandisha, wakali kuyamine kufafi anguwe. <verse eid="JHN 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24" />Ono Simoni wakadokola shichiiya uyo akwaamba ati, “Mubuzhe, ino nguni ngwatokwaamba.”<verse eid="JHN 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25" />Ono shichiiya kayeeme kuli Jesu wakaamba ati, “Ino nguni, O Mwami?” <verse eid="JHN 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26" />Jesu wakanviila ati, “Ngoyo ngunshi mpe kapanzha kachinkwa nkeshi nsumpe mwakunwiina. Amane wakasumpa kapanzha ka chinkwa, akukapa Judasi, mwana a Saimoni Isikalyoti. <verse eid="JHN 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27" />Peenka penka Judasi nakabweza kankwa, wakanjilwa Satani muli nguwe, Jesu wakamwambila ati, “Icho nchoyanda kuchita chichite kufambana.” <verse eid="JHN 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28" />Ono benzhinyina mbakalinga kulya anguwe taaku bakazhiba nkambo nzhi nchakamwaambililila bobu Judasi. <verse eid="JHN 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29" />Ono mbukuli Judasi ngu wakalinga muyobozhi wa maali, bamwi bakayeeya kwaamba, Jesu wakalinga kumwaambila kwaamba akaule zhintu zhiyandika ku Pobwe, naa kupa zhintu kubachete.<verse eid="JHN 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30" />Peenka penka Judasi nakabweza chinkwa wakazwa. Alimwi akalinga mashiku.<verse eid="JHN 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mulawo mupya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31" />Ono Judasi nakaunka, Jesu wakaamba ati, “Ono Mwana a Muntu alemekwa alimwi Leza walemekwa muli nguwe. <verse eid="JHN 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32" />Naa Leza ulalemekwa muli nguwe, Leza ulakulemeka mwanakwe kwiinda mulinguwe, alimwi ulakulemekwa a chiindi chomwi. <verse eid="JHN 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33" />Nubana bangu, ndaba andimwe kwa chiindi chishoonto. Mulakunagaula, alimwi bweenka mbundakaambila ba Juuda, andimwe ndamwaambila ono, ‘Uko nkutekuunka inga tamuzi.’ <verse eid="JHN 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34" />Ndamupa mulawo mupya wakwaamba. amuyandane kuli omwi a omwi bweenka mbundakamuyanda, ono mulyeelele kuyandana kuli omwi a omwi. <verse eid="JHN 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35" />Ono mwaakuyandana omwi a omwi boonse bantu balakuzhiba kwaamba muli bashichiiya bangu.”<verse eid="JHN 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kukaaka kwa Petulo kwaambwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mateyo 26.31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Maako 14.27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luuka 22.31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36" />Simon Petulo bakamubuzha ati, “Mwami, ina nkuli nkutekuunka?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:36">Jesu wakanviila ati, “Ime nkutekuunka, inga tamuchilili ono, pesi mulakunchilila chakushika chiindi.”<verse eid="JHN 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37" />Petulo wakabuzha ati, “Mwami nkambo nzhi nchiinga nshikuchili ono?” “Ndilibambile kukufila!”<verse eid="JHN 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38" />Amane Jesu wakanviila ati, “Ulimasimpe wanda kufa ali ndime? Nchanchobeni ndakwaambila, mukombwe katana kulila ulakunkaka zhiindi zhotatwe kwaamba tonzhi.<verse eid="JHN 13:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14" />
  <para style="s">Jesu ninzhila iya kuli Taata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1" />“Myoyo yanu itapengi. “Amushome muli Leza, alimwi mushome a mulindime. <verse eid="JHN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2" />Mu Ng'anda ya Taata muli makalilo maanji, nikwatalinga bobu nindamwaambila. Ndaunka kwaamba nkamubambile masena. <verse eid="JHN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3" />Ndakumana kumubambila masena, ndakuza alimwi kwaamba kamutole uko nkumbele, kwaamba uko nkumbele, mukabe nkuko andimwe. <verse eid="JHN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4" />Muliizhi nzhila iya nkutokuunka.”<verse eid="JHN 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5" />Tomasi wakamwaambila ati, “O Mwami, tatuzhi nkutekuunka, ino nzhila inga twaizhiba buti?”<verse eid="JHN 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6" />Ono Jesu wakamunviila ati, “Ime ndime nzhila, ndime kashimpe, alimwi ndime buumi, taaku muntu ukonzha kuunka kuli Taata chita kwiindila mulindime. <verse eid="JHN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7" />Naa mwalinga kunzhi kabotu, awalo Taata nimwalinga kumuzhi. Pesi kuzwa ono mulimuzhi alimwi mwakamubona.”<verse eid="JHN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8" />Filipo wakamwaambila ati, “O Mwami, tutondezhe Taata kwamana kulazulila kulindiswe.”<verse eid="JHN 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9" />Jesu wakanviila ati, “Filipo saa tamunzhi, nikuba kwaamba ndalinga adimwe kwa chiindi chilaamfu? Nkukuti asunu tamunakunzhiba? Mfumbwa wabona ndime, wabona a Taata. Ino inga mwaamba buti ati, ‘Tutondezhe Taata?’ <verse eid="JHN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10" />Saa tamuzhi kwaamba ndi muli Taata, alimwi akwaamba awalo ulimulindime? Majwi ngugamba kulindimwe taazwi mu nguzu zhangu ndimwiine, pesi nkambo ka Taata uyo uli mulindime ngu nsebenza nchito yakwe kwiinda mulindime. <verse eid="JHN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11" />Amunshome naa ndaamba ati ndi muli Taata alimwi Taata uli mulindime. Naa tabushi boo, amushome a kaambo ka milimo njibachita. <verse eid="JHN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12" />Nchachobeni ndamwambila, uyo ushoma mulindime ulakusebenza nchito njindakalinga kusebenza, alimwi balakuchita nchito zhinene kwiinda zhezhi, nkambo ndaunka kuli Taata. <verse eid="JHN 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13" />Alimwi ndakuchita kufumbwa nchishimukalombe muzhina lyangu, kwaamba Taata alemekwe kwiinda mu mwaana. <verse eid="JHN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14" />Naa mwanoomba kufumbwa nchimuyanda mu liina lyangu, ndakumuchitila.<verse eid="JHN 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu washomezha Muuya Usalala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15" />Naa ulanyanda, bamba mulawo wangu. <verse eid="JHN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16" />Alimwi ndakulomba kuli Taata, alimwi ulakukupa aumwi mugwashi kwaamba ukabe anguwe kukabe kutamani. <verse eid="JHN 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17" />Muuya wakashimpe nyika ngwitazumini, nkambo taimuboni naa kumuzhiba. Pesi muli muzhi, nkambo ulapona adimwe alimwi ulakuba muli ndimwe.<verse eid="JHN 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18" />“Taaku ninja kumushiya mbuli bamuchaala, ndakuza kuli ndimwe. <verse eid="JHN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19" />Ono kwakaiindi kashoonto nyika taikamboni alimwi, pesi imwe mulakumbona. Nkambo ndapona andimwe mulakupona. <verse eid="JHN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20" />Mubuzuba ubo mulakuzhiba kwaamba ndi muli Taata, andimwe muli mulindime, andime mulindimwe.<verse eid="JHN 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21" />“Uyo utambula milawo yangu akwichilila nguwoyo unyanda. Uyo unyanda awalo Taata ulakumuyanda, andime ndakumuyanda akulitondezha kulimbabo.”<verse eid="JHN 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22" />Ono Judasi (kutaashi Judasi isikaliyoti) wakaamba, pesi, Mwami, ino nkambo nzhi ulanda kulitondezha kulindiswe alimwi kutaashi kunyika?” <verse eid="JHN 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23" />Jesu wakanviila ati, “Mfumbwa unyanda ulakuchilila njiisho zhangu, Taata ulakubayanda, alimwi ulakuza kuli mbabo akupona ambabo. <verse eid="JHN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24" />Uyo utanyandi tachilili njiisho zhangu. Aya majwi ngumunva taashi aangu alazwa kuli Taata wakantuma.<verse eid="JHN 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25" />“Aaya oonse ndaamba kanchili andimwe. <verse eid="JHN 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26" />Pesi mugwashi, Muuya Usalala, uyo Taata ngweshiakatume mu liina lyangu, ulakumuiisha zhintu zhoonse alimwi akumuyeezha zhintu zhoonse zhinda kamwaambila.<verse eid="JHN 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27" />“Ndamushila lumuno. Ndamupa lumuno lwangu, taaku ndamupa mbuli nyika mbwiipa. Myoyo yanu itapengi alimwi mutatiji. <verse eid="JHN 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28" />Mwakanva nkagamba ati, ‘Ndaunka alimwi ndakujoka kulindimwe.’ Nimwalinga kunyanda, nimwakomana kwaamba ndaunka kuli Taata, nkambo Taata munene kwiinda ndime. <verse eid="JHN 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29" />Ndamwaambila ono zhintu kazhitana kuchitika, kwaamba zhakuchitika mukashome. <verse eid="JHN 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30" />Taaku zhiinji nzhinshi ngambe, nkambo mwendelezhi wanyika ulaza, tachite nguzu zhakunkoma, <verse eid="JHN 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31" />pesi ulaza kwaamba nyika izhibe kwaamba Taata ndamuyanda alimwi ndachita izho nzhandailila kuchita.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 14:31">“Kamuza ono tuzwe abusena ano. tuunke.<verse eid="JHN 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15" />
  <para style="s">Makani achishiko amisaampi ya nchincho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1" />“Ndime muchelo wa kashimpe, alimwi Taata ngumwiine muunda. <verse eid="JHN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2" />Ono kufumbwa musaampi utazhali muchelo mulindime ulauzutaula, pesi musaampi uzhala michelo ulaubambila kwaamba uzhalishe michelo kwiindilila. <verse eid="JHN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3" />Imwe mulisalazhilwe kale amajwi ngundakamwaambila. <verse eid="JHN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4" />Amukalilile mulindime, andime mulindimwe. Bweenka mbwiinga musaampi taukonzhi kuzhala michelo wanakuli weenka, kautajatile kuchishiko, andimwe bweenka tamukonzhi kuzhala michelo chita kamuchite kulindime.<verse eid="JHN 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5" />Ndime misansa, imwe ndimwe misaampi. Uyo ukkalilila muli ndime andime muli nguwe, ngushi akazhale michelo miinji, nkambo naa kamwandene andime taaku nchimukonzha kuchita. <verse eid="JHN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6" />Ono naa mwabula kukkala mulindime, muli mbuli musaampi wazutulwa alimwi wayuma, iyo misaampi ilabwezelelwa, akuwaalwa mu mulilo alimwi akutentwa. <verse eid="JHN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7" />Ono naa mwakkalilila mulindime amajwi angu akkala mulindimwe, mukalombe mfumbwa nchimuyanda, alimwi chilakupegwa kulindimwe. <verse eid="JHN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8" />Ubu mbulemu bwa Taata kwaamba muzhale michelo iinji, kutondezha kwaamba muli bashichiiya baangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9" />“Mbuli Taata mbwakanyanda, bweenka andime ndamuyanda. Amukkalilile muluyando lwangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10" />Ono naa mwabamba milawo yangu, mulakukkalilila muluyando lwangu bweenka mbundakabamba milawo ya Taata alimwi akukkalilila muluyando lwakwe.<verse eid="JHN 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11" />Ndamwaambila zhintu izhi kwaamba kukomana kwangu kube mulindimwe alimwi kwaamba kube kumaninine. <verse eid="JHN 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12" />Mulawo wangu ngoyu, a muyandane kuli omwi aomwi bweenka mbundakamuyanda. <verse eid="JHN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13" />Taaku mulawo wiinda uyu, kufila buumi bwakwe nkambo ka buumi bwamwenzhinyina. <verse eid="JHN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14" />Mulibenzuma naa mwachita nchindamulailila. <verse eid="JHN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15" />Nshika mwiiti limbi ati basebenzhi, nkambo musebenzhi tazhi zhichita shimalelo akwe, anu, ndamwiita ati muli beenzuma, nkambo oonse makani ngundakanva kuli Taata ndakamuzhibya. <verse eid="JHN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16" />Taaku mwakansaala, pesi ndime ndakamusala kwaamba mupe mulimo wakuchita kwaamba mukazhale michelo, michelo ikkalilila a kwaamba mfumbwa ncheshi mukalombe mu liina lyangu, Taata ulakumupa. <verse eid="JHN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17" />Uyu ngu mulawo wangu, amuyandane kuli omwi a omwi.<verse eid="JHN 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bantu balakumusulaika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18" />“Ono naa banyika bakusulaika, kozhiba kwaamba yakasulaika ndime kutaanguna. <verse eid="JHN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19" />Naa wakalikuzulilwa munyika, nibalinga kukuyanda nkambo nimwakalinga bamwi babo. Mbuli mbuchibele, tamushi banyika, pesi ndakamusala kuzwa mulinjiyo. Nkukambo ako nyika nchimusulaikila. <verse eid="JHN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20" />Amuyeeye majwi ngundakamwaambila akwaamba ati, ‘Musebenzhi takonzhi kwiinda shimalelo akwe.’ Naa ime bakampenzha, balakumupenzha andimwe. Naa bakachilila njiisho zhangu, andimwe njiisho zhanu balakuzhishilila. <verse eid="JHN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21" />Ono balakumupenzhela nkambo ka liina lyangu, nkambo tabamuzhi uyo wakantuma. <verse eid="JHN 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22" />Nindatakaza, mukwaamba kuli mbabo, nibatakalinga kuchite mulandu wachinyonyono, pesi ono tabachite chakulitamizha kuchinyonyono chabo. <verse eid="JHN 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23" />Uyo usulaika ndime ulasulaika a Taata. <verse eid="JHN 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24" />Nindatakachita milimo iitanakuchitwako kale amuntu naba omwe, nibatalinga kuchite mulandu wachinyonyono. Mbuli mbuchibele bakaibona, alimwi bakansulaika ime a Taata. <verse eid="JHN 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25" />Pesi ichi chilazuzikizha icho chakalembwa mu mulawo wa Mozesi ati, ‘Bakansulaikila ataaku kaambo!’<verse eid="JHN 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26" />“Ono mugwashi akuza, uyo ngunshi nkatume kuzwa kuli Taata, ngu Muuya wakashimpe uzwa kuli Taata. Ulakupa bumboni alindime. <verse eid="JHN 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27" />Alimwi andimwe mulyeelele kupa bumboni, nkambo mwakalinga andime kuzwa kumatalikilo.<verse eid="JHN 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1" />“Ono zhoonse izhi ndamwaambila kwaamba mutakabishi. <verse eid="JHN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2" />Balakumugusha mu sinagogo, chiindi chilakushika bamwi neshi bakamujaye kabayeeya kwaamba bachitila Leza milimo mibotu. <verse eid="JHN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3" />Balakuchita bobu nkambo taaku bamuzhiba Taata, andime tabanzhi. <verse eid="JHN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4" />Ono ndamwaambila izhi kwaamba chiindi chaakushika mukayeeye kwaamba ndakamuchenjezha ali mbabo. Taaku ndakamwaambila kuzwa kumatalikilo nkambo ndakalinga andimwe.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 16:4">Mulimo wa Muuya Usalala</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 16:4">“Taaku ndakamwaambila kuzwa kumatalikilo nkambo ndakalinga andimwe. <verse eid="JHN 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5" />Pesi ono ndaunka kuli uyo wakantuma, kakuli taaku naba omwi kwaamba nkuli nkungunka. <verse eid="JHN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6" />Pesi a kaambo ka kwaamba ndamwambila makani aya, myoyo yanu yausa. <verse eid="JHN 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7" />Nchanchobeni ndamwaambila kwaamba, kuunka kwangu nimpindu yanu, chita nzwe ko mugwashi takazi kulindimwe, pesi naa nkaunke ndakumutuma kuza kuli ndimwe. <verse eid="JHN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8" />Ono akuza, ulakubazula ba munyika balilubizhile mu mulandu wa chinyonyono, akusalala a lubeta. <verse eid="JHN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9" />Ono makani achinyonyono nkambo bantu tabanshoomi, <verse eid="JHN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10" />a kusalala, nkambo ndajokela kuli Taata, uko nkushimutakamboni limbi. <verse eid="JHN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11" />Akaambo kalubeta mwendelezhi wa nyika iyi wabetekwa.<verse eid="JHN 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12" />“Ndichite makani aanji aakumwambila, pesi inga tamwakonzhi kwanva. <verse eid="JHN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13" />Pesi ono uyo, Muuya wakashimpe akuza, ulakumutondezha kashimpe koonse. Nkambo takaambi zhaakwe mwiine, pesi ulakupandulula izho zhoonse nzhakanva kuli Taata, alimwi ulakumwaambila zhintu zhichiza. <verse eid="JHN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14" />Ulakundemeka nkambo nzheshi akano kumuzhibya zhilakuzwa kulindime. <verse eid="JHN 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15" />Zhoonse izho Taata nzhachite nzhaangu, nku kaambo kako nchindakamwaambilila kwaamba Muuya ulakutambula kuzwa kuli ndime icho ncheshi akamuzhibye.<verse eid="JHN 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuusa a kukomana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16" />Jesu wakazumanana waamba ati, “Kwa chiindi chishoonto tamukamboni, alimwi kwakwiinda kaindi kashoonto mulakumbona.”<verse eid="JHN 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17" />Ono nkambo kachechi, bamwi babashichiiya bakwe bakatalika kubuzhanya buzhanya kuli omwi a omwi ati, “Ino makani nzhi ichi? Ulaamba kwa kwiinda kaindi kashoonto tamukamboni, alimwi kwaakuba kaindi kashoonto mulakumbona, alimwi ulaamba ati, ‘Nkambo ndaunka kuli Taata.’ <verse eid="JHN 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18" />Bakazumanana kubuzha ati, “Ino kaindi kashoonto chilaamba nzhi? Tatuzhi nchaamba!”<verse eid="JHN 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19" />Jesu wakazhiba kwaamba balanda kumubuzha, ono wakabaambila ati, “Ndakaamba ati, ‘Kwa kaindi kashoonto tamukamboni, alimwi kwa kwiinda kaindi kashoonto mulakumbona? <verse eid="JHN 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20" />Nchanchobeni ndamwambila ati, mulakulila akuusa kakuli nyika yalo illakuna kusekelela. Mulakuusa akuba a buumba, pesi kuusa kwanu kulakuba mukusekelela. <verse eid="JHN 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21" />Mukaintu uyanda kutumbuka mwaana ulaba mumachise nkambo chiindi chakutumbuka chashika, pesi naa mwanaakwe watumbukwa ulaluba mapenzhi akwe nkambo kakusekelela kwa mwaana wazhalwa munyika. <verse eid="JHN 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22" />Ono kulindimwe, chino nchi chiindi cha kuusa, pesi ndakumubona alimwi, alimwi mulakusekelela, alimwi taaku eshi akamunyange kusekelela uko.<verse eid="JHN 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23" />Mubuzuba ubo taaku nchishimukalombe. Nchanchobeni ndamwambila kwaamba, Taata ulakumupa mfumbwa nchimushimukalombe mu liina lyangu. <verse eid="JHN 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24" />Kushikila ono, tamuna kulomba chintu nachiba chomwi mu liina lyangu. Amulombe alimwi mulakutambula, alimwi kusekelela kwanu kulakuba kumaninine.<verse eid="JHN 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuzunda mu nyika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25" />“Ono nakuba kwaamba ndasebenzha mumansendekela, chiindi chilakushika nenshi ntakasebenzhi mulaka uyu pesi ndakumwaambila chantangalala makani a Taata. <verse eid="JHN 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26" />Mu buzuba ubu mulakulomba mu liina lyangu, nshaambi kwaamba ndaakumulombela kuli Taata. <verse eid="JHN 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27" />Taaku, Taata mwiine ulamuyanda nkambo mwakanyanda akushoma kwaamba ndakazwa kuli Leza. <verse eid="JHN 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28" />Ndakazwa kuli Taata a kunjila munyika, ono ntekuzwa mu nyika a kujokela kuli Taata.”<verse eid="JHN 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29" />Ono bashichiiya bakwe bakaamba ati, “Ono ulaamba chantangalala kwakubula kwaamba mumansendekela. <verse eid="JHN 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30" />Ono twabona kwaamba mulizhi zhoonse zhintu, alimwi kwaamba tamuyandiki a muntu kumubuzha mibuzho. Ichi chilatupa kushoma kwaamba mwakazwa kuli Leza.<verse eid="JHN 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31" />Jesu wakabanviila ati, “Saa ono mulashoma? <verse eid="JHN 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32" />Chiindi chilakushika alimwi chashika kale, neshi mukamwaike kuunka mwanu mwanu. Mulakunshiiya boo neenka. Nakuba kwaamba nshinooli neenka, nkambo Taata uli andime. <verse eid="JHN 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33" />Ndamwaambila izhi zhintu, kwaamba mulindime mukabe alumuno. Muno munyika mulakuba a mapenzhi. Pesi amukazhike myoyo! Ndaizunda nyika!”<verse eid="JHN 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17" />
  <para style="s">Jesu akapailila bashichiiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1" />Nakamana Jesu kwaamba chechi, wakalanga ku julu a kupaila, “Taata, chiindi chashika ono. Pa mwanako bulemu kwaamba mwanaako akupe bulemu. <verse eid="JHN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2" />Nkambo wakamupa nguzu zha kweendelezha bantu boonse kwaamba abape buumi butamani kubatu boonse mbakamupa. <verse eid="JHN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3" />Ono ubu mbuumi butamani, kwaamba bakuzhibe iwe kwaamba Leza wakashimpe, a Jesu Kilisitu nguwakatuma. <verse eid="JHN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4" />Ndakulemeka kunyika mukumanizha mulimo nguwakantuma kuchita. <verse eid="JHN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5" />Alimwi ono, Taata, kondemeka abushu bwako, kondemeka abulemu ubo mbundakalikuchite andimwe nyika kaitana kulengwa.<verse eid="JHN 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6" />“Ono ndakuzubula kuzwa babo mbuwakampa kuzwa mu nyika. Bakalinga baako, wakabapa kuli ndime alimwi bakachilila malailile a jwi lyako. <verse eid="JHN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7" />Ono balizhi kwaamba zhoonse nzhiwakampa zhakazwa kuli ndiwe. <verse eid="JHN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8" />Nkaambo ndakapa majwi ayo nguwakandailila. Alimwi bakatambula, ono balizhi mashimpe ati ndakazwa kulindiwe alimwi bakashoma ndiwe kwaamba wakantuma.<verse eid="JHN 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9" />“Aba mbumbabo mbu pailila. Nshipailili ba munyika pesi abo mbuwakampa, nkambo mbaako. <verse eid="JHN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10" />Zhoonse nzhichite nzhaako, alimwi zhoonse zhochite nzhaangu. Alimwi bulemu bulaboneka kwiinda muli mbabo. <verse eid="JHN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11" />Ono teshi nkale alimwi munyika, pesi balo bachili munyika, alimwi ndaza uko nkobele. Taata Nusalala, kobakwabilila anguzu zha liina lyako, liina ndiwakampa, kwaamba babe omwi, bweenka andiswe mbuli mbutubele omwi. <verse eid="JHN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12" />Kanchili ambabo, ndakabakwabilila alimwi ndakababamba kwiinda mu liina ndiwakampa. Taaku naba omwi wakasoweka chita boo uyo wakabikwa kuleta mapenzhi kwaamba malembe azuzikizhigwe. <verse eid="JHN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13" />Ono ndaza kulindimwe, pesi ndaamba zhintu izhi kanchili munyika, kwaamba babe a kukomana kwangu kuzwile muli mbabo. <verse eid="JHN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14" />Ndabapa jwi lyako alimwi nyika yabasulaika, nkambo tabachili bamu nyika limbi bweenka mbuntali wa mu nyika. <verse eid="JHN 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15" />Nshipaililili kwaamba ubagushe mu nyika, pesi kwaamba ubakwabilile kuzwa kumubiibi. <verse eid="JHN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16" />Tabashi banyika bweenka andime mbuntali wanjiyo. <verse eid="JHN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17" />Basalazhe a kashimpe, ijwi lyako nkashimpe. <verse eid="JHN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18" />Bweenka mbuwakantuma munyika, andime ndabatuma mu nyika. <verse eid="JHN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19" />Nkambo kambabo ndalisalazha kuli ndiwe, kwaamba bweenka abalo balipe cha kachimpe kulindiwe.<verse eid="JHN 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20" />“Ono nshipailili boo beenka aba, ndapailila abaabo beshi bakashome muli ndime kwiinda mu majwi ababo. <verse eid="JHN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21" />Ndapaila kwaamba boonse babe omwi, bweenka iwe Taata mboli muli ndime, andime ndi mulindimwe, abalo bweenka babe mulindiswe kwaamba nyika yoonse ikabashome kwaamba wakantuma. <verse eid="JHN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22" />Ndabapa bulemu mbuwakampa, kwaamba babe omwi bweenka andiswe mbutuli omwi. <verse eid="JHN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23" />Ime mbe mulimbabo, andiwe mulindime, kwaamba abalo bakamantane chanchobeni, kwaamba nyika izhibe ati ndiwe wakantuma akwaamba wakabayanda bweenka mbuwanyanda andime.<verse eid="JHN 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24" />“Taata! Wakabapa kuli ndime, alimwi ndayanda kwaamba baya mbuwakampa babe andime uko kumbele, alimwi babone bulemu bwangu mbuwakampa nkambo wakanyanda nyika kaitana kulengwe. <verse eid="JHN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25" />Taata Ululeme! Nakuba kwaamba nyika taikuzhi, ime ndikuzhi alimwi aba balizhi kwaamba wakantuma. <verse eid="JHN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26" />Ndakuchita kwaamba uzhibikwe mulimbabo, alimwi ndakuzumanana kwaamba uzhibike kuchita kwaamba luyando nduchite kulindime lube muli mbabo alimwi kwaamba andime mbe muli mbabo.”<verse eid="JHN 17:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18" />
  <para style="s">Jesu wakaangwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mateyo 26.47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Maako 14.43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luuka 22.47-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1" />Nakamana kupaila, Jesu wakaunka a bashichiiya bakwe, wakazubuka Chibanda cha Kidiloni. Kulubazu lumwi kwakalinga muunda, alimwi Jesu a bashichiiya bakwe bakanjila mu muunda uyo. <verse eid="JHN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2" />Ono Judasi wakaaba Jesu, wakalinga kubuzhi busena ubo, nkambo Jesu nkubakalinga kuswanganina a bashichiiya bakwe lyoonse. <verse eid="JHN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3" />Amane Judasi wakashika ku muunda, kasololela bashikalumamba baba paizhi banene aba Faliisi bakalinga kuchite malapi a zhilwanyo. <verse eid="JHN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4" />Ono Jesu wakalinga kuzhi zhoonse zheshi zhikachitike kuli nguwe, abobo wakaunka a kubabuzha ati, “Ino nguni ngumulangaula?”<verse eid="JHN 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5" />Bakanviila ati, “Jesu waku Nazaleti,”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">“Ndime,” wakanviila.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">Judasi, uyo wakamwaaba wakalinga kwinvi ambabo. <verse eid="JHN 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6" />Amane Jesu nakabaambila ati, “Ndime,” bakaswena muunshi akuliwaala anshi. <verse eid="JHN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7" />Jesu wakababuzha ati, “Ino nguni ngumulangaula?” Alimwi bakanviila ati,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:7">“Jesu waku Nazaleti.”<verse eid="JHN 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8" />Jesu wakanviila ati, “Ndamwaambila kale kwaamba Ndime. “Naa, anu mulalangaula ndime amuleke aba bamwi bantu baunke.” <verse eid="JHN 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9" />(Ichi chakachitika kwaamba majwi ngakaamba azuzikizhigwe, “Taata, Taaku naba omwi wababo mbuwakampa mbundakaswokelwa.”)<verse eid="JHN 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10" />Penka awo Simoni Petulo wakalinga kuchite panga, wakaligusha a kuzutula litwi lyalulyo lyamuzhike wamu paizhi munene. (Musebenzhi uyu liina lyakwe wakalinga Malukasi.) <verse eid="JHN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11" />Ono Jesu wakalalila Petulo ati, “Bikka panga nkulikala! Saa mulayeeya kwaamba nshikanwi ku nkaapu njakampa Taata?”<verse eid="JHN 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu wakabetekwa a Anasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12" />Ono bashilumamba abo amunene wabo, abalindizhi bakatumwa abanene, bakajata Jesu akumwaanga. <verse eid="JHN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13" />Alimwi bakataanguna kumutola kuli Anasi, mukwe wa Kaifasi wakalinga mu paizhi munene mumwaaka uyo. <verse eid="JHN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14" />Kaifasi ngu nguwe uyu wakaambila basololi baba Juuda kwaamba inga chabota muntu omwi kufila bantu boonse.<verse eid="JHN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petulo watama Jesu chiindi chakutaanguna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-70">Mateyo 26.69-70</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-68">Maako 14.66-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:55-57">Luuka 22.55-57</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15" />Simoni Petulo aumwi shichiiya bakalinga kuchilila Jesu. Nkambo shichiiya uyo wakalinga kuzhibikilwe kumu paizhi munene, wakaunka a Jesu mu lubaanza lwa mu paizhi munene. <verse eid="JHN 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16" />Pesi Petulo wakashaala kalindila ansengwe amulyango kainvi ku manjililo. Ono shichiiya umwi wakalikuzhibikilwe a mu paizhi munene wakajoka akwaambila mushimbi wakalinga a mulimo kwaamba amunjize Petulo. <verse eid="JHN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17" />Mushimbi wakabuzha Petulo ati, “Saa tooshi umwi waba shichiiya ba muntu uyu, saa ndiwe?” Petulo wakanviila ati, ‘‘Nshiinshi.”<verse eid="JHN 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18" />Kwakalinga kutontola, alimwi basebenzhi a bamwi ba chinenenene ba chi Juuda bakalinga kwimikene kabayota mulilo ngubakakunka, awalo Petulo kayota mulilo ambabo.<verse eid="JHN 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu wabetekwa amu paizhi munene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mateyo 26.59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Maako 14.55-64</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:66-71">Luuka 22.66-71</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19" />Ono mu Paizhi Munene wakatalika kubuzhabuzha Jesu zha bashichiiya bakwe a zha njiisho yakwe. <verse eid="JHN 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20" />Jesu wakanviila ati, “Ndakalinga kuiisha bantu chantangalala. Lyoonse ndakalinga kuiisha muma sinagogo naa mu tempele, uko ba Juuda nkubakalinga kubungana antomwi. Taaku nchindakaamba chamaseseke. <verse eid="JHN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21" />Ino ulambuzhila nzhi? Kobuzha babo bakalinga kunva. Nchachobeni balizhi nchindakaamba.”<verse eid="JHN 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22" />Ono Jesu nakamana kwaamba chechi, umwi wabanene wakalinga kwinvi afaafi wakauma Jesu lupaka ku meenso. “Saa mbwiinga wanviila mu Paizhi Munene ubu!”<verse eid="JHN 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23" />Jesu wakamunviila ati, “Naa ndaamba chitali kabotu, kamumwaamba icho nchindalubizha. Pesi naa ndaamba kashimpe, ino wangumina nzhi?”<verse eid="JHN 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24" />Ono Anasi wakatuma Jesu kangilwe kuli Kaifasi mu Paizhi Munene.<verse eid="JHN 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petulo watama Jesu lwabili a lwatatu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:71-75">Mateyo 26.71-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:69-72">Maako 14.69-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:58-62">Luuka 22.58-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25" />Ono Petulo kachiinvi kayota mulilo. Bamane bakamubuzha ati, “Saa iwe toli umwi wa bashichiiya bakwe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:25">Walo wakatama a kwaamba ati, “Taaku, nshili umwi wabo.”<verse eid="JHN 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26" />Umwi musebenzhi wa mu Paizhi Munene, wakalinga mwenzhinyina a muntu uyo ngwakatimbula litwi Petulo, wakamubuzha ati, “Saa iwe taaku ndakubona sunu kounka ku muunda koli antomwi a muntu ulya?”<verse eid="JHN 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27" />Alimwi Petulo wakaamba ati, “Taaku” alimwi peenka penka mukombwe wakalila.<verse eid="JHN 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu wabetekwa a Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mateyo 27.1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Maako 15.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luuka 23.1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28" />Ono kuseeni seeni (muma 5 koloko) bakamutola ku ng'anda ya mweendelezhi wachi Looma kuzwa kuli Kaifasi, alimwi banene baba Juuda taaku bakayanda kunjila mu nkunta yakubetekela nkambo bakatija kusofwaana lwabo beene. Nkambo bakalinga kuyanda kulya pobwe lya Pasika. <verse eid="JHN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29" />Ono Pilato wakazwa ansengwe akubuzha ati, “Ino mwamupa mulandu nzhi muntu uyu?”<verse eid="JHN 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30" />Natalinga kabwalala niinga tatumuleti kulindiwe, bakanviila niinga tatumupi kulindiwe.”<verse eid="JHN 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31" />Pilato wakanviila ati, “Amumutole nubeene imwe mukamubeteke kweendelana a milawo yanu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:31">Bakanviila ati, “Tatuchite mulawo utuzumizha kujaya mfumbwa muntu.” <verse eid="JHN 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32" />Ichi chakachitika kuzuzikizha nchakaamba a lufu ndweshi akafe Jesu.<verse eid="JHN 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33" />Pilato wakanjila alimwi mu ng'anda yakubetekela, akwiita Jesu akumubuzha ati, “Saa nduwe Mwami waba Juuda?”<verse eid="JHN 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34" />Jesu wakabuzha ati, “Saa muzeezo wako uyo, naa kuli boo bamwi bakwaambila a lindime?”<verse eid="JHN 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35" />Pilato wakanviila ati, “Saa ulayeeya ati ime ndimu Juuda? Bantu bamushobo wako antomwi aba paizhi banene mbubakuleta kuli ndime, ino wakachita nzhi?”<verse eid="JHN 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36" />Jesu wakanviila ati, “Bwami bwangu tabuli bwanyika ino. Nibwakalinga bwa nyika ino, niinga basebenzhi bandwanina kwaamba ntaangwi aba sololi baba Juuda. Pesi ono bwami bwangu bulazwa kumbi!”<verse eid="JHN 18:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37" />Pilato wakamubuzha ati, “Saa anu uli Mwami?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:37">Jesu wakanviila ati, “Waamba ati ndimwami, nkukaambo nkudakazila munyika alimwi chindakazhalilwa kuza munyika ino, kwaamba mpe bumboni bwa mashimpe, abobo kufumbwa muntu uzhi zhamashimpe ulatelela kuli ndime.”<verse eid="JHN 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38" />Pilato wakabuzha ati, “Ino kashimpe ninzhi?”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 18:38">Jesu wapegwa mulandu wa lufu</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 18:38">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-31">Mateyo 27.15-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-20">Maako 15.6-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luuka 23.13-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:38">Kuchechi wakazwa alimwi wababunganya bama Juuda a kwaamba ati, “Taaku kaambo nkundajana kakumupa mulandu uyu muntu.<verse eid="JHN 18:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39" />Pesi nchilengwa chanu chakwaamba ati ndyeelele kumwangulwila mwaange omwi chiindi cha pobwe lya Pasika. Saa mulayanda ati mwangulwile uyu Mwami waba Juuda?”<verse eid="JHN 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40" />Pesi bantu bakoongolola ati, “Kotwaangulwila Banabbasi, kutaashi muntu uyu!” (Banabbasi uyu wakalinga mubbi.)<verse eid="JHN 18:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1" />Ono Pilato wakatola Jesu kwaamba akwipwe. <verse eid="JHN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2" />Abalo bashikalumamba bakaanga mushini wamaanva, a kumusamika ku mutwi, alimwi bakamusamika chibachi chansombo <verse eid="JHN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3" />alimwi bakaunka bakajokoloka kulinguwe akwaamba ati, “Pona lyoonse, O Mwami waba Juuda!” Alimwi bakamuuma lupaka ku meenso.<verse eid="JHN 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4" />Ono alimwi Pilato wakazwa ansengwe a kwaamba kuba Juuda ati, “Amulange ndamuleta ansengwe kulindimwe kwaamba muzhibe kwaamba taaku mulandu ngundamujanina!” <verse eid="JHN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5" />Ono Jesu nakazwa ansengwe kasamine mushini wamaanva achibachi chansombo, amane Pilato wakabaambila ati, “Amulange ngoyu muntu!”<verse eid="JHN 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6" />Peenka penka ba Paizhi Banene a bantu babo nibakabona, bakoongolola a kwaamba ati, “Agagailwe! Agagailwe!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:6">Pilato wakabaambila ati, “Kamumutola mumungagaile, nkambo ime taaku mulandu ngundamujanina.”<verse eid="JHN 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7" />Basololi baba Juuda bakavila kwaamba ati, “Tulichite mulawo, alimwi kweendelana a mulawo wesu muntu uyu ulyeelele kufa, nkambo ulalyaamba ati Mwana a Leza.”<verse eid="JHN 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8" />Ono Pilato nakanva ichi, wakatija maningi. <verse eid="JHN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9" />Alimwi wakanjila munkuta akubuzha Jesu ati, “Ino ulazwa kuli?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:9">Pesi Jesu taaku nakamunviila. <verse eid="JHN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10" />Pilato wakamwaambila ati, “Saa ulakaka kwaamba andime? Tozhi kwaamba ndichite nguzu zhakukwangulula naa zhakwaamba ukugagailwe.”<verse eid="JHN 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11" />Jesu wakanviila ati, “Niwatakapegwa nguzu kuzwa ku julu niinga tochite nguzu zhakumbeteka. Nakuba bobu uyu wakampa mumaanza ako ngu chite chinyonyono chinene.”<verse eid="JHN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12" />Nakanva boobu Pilato wakalinga kuyanda kumwangulula, Pesi ba Juuda bakoongolola a kwaamba ati, “Naa umwangulule muntu uyu, nkukwaamba toli mweenzhinyina a Kaisala. Kufumbwa muntu uyanda kuba mwami ngushinkondonyina a Kasaila!”<verse eid="JHN 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13" />Ono Pilato naakanva ichi, wakaleta Jesu ansengwe alimwi wamukkalika anshi ku babeteshi abusena bwambwa ati, “lubaanza lwamabwe apampamene ayalene mwakubetekela.” (mu Alameki liina “Gabbata.”) <verse eid="JHN 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14" />Bwakalinga buzuba bwakulibambila zha Pobwe a chiindi cha malumwi (12 koloko). Pilato wakaambila ba Juuda ati, “Ngooyu Mwami wanu!”<verse eid="JHN 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15" />Balo bamane bakoongolola ati, “Amumujaye! Amumujaye! Agagailwe!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Pilato wakababuzha ati, “Saa mugagaile Mwami wanu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Ba paizhi banene bakaamba ati, “Tatuchite Mwami umbi kunze kwa Kaisala muleli munene waku Looma!”<verse eid="JHN 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16" />Kumamanino Pilato wakamupa mu maanza abo kwaamba bakamugagaile.<verse eid="JHN 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu wakagagailwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mateyo 27.32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Maako 15.21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luuka 23.26-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17" />Bamane bashikalumamba bakamutola Jesu. Wakazwa mu munzhi kanyamwine achichingano chakwe kuunka kubusena bwa, “Kapapa kakumutwi,” (mu chihibulu chaamba ati, “Gologota.”) <verse eid="JHN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18" />Uko bakamugagaila antomwi a basankwa bobilo bamwi, umwi kulubazu lwalulyo umwi kulubazu lwa kulumwenshi, Jesu akati. <verse eid="JHN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19" />Pilato wakalemba chizhibisho akuchibika achingano cha Jesu. Chizhibisho ichi chakalinga kulembelwe ati, “JESU WAKU NAZALETI, MWAMI WABA JUUDA,” <verse eid="JHN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20" />Ba Juuda baanji bakachibala chizhibisho icho nkambo ubo busena nkwakagagailwa bwakalinga kumbali amunzhi munene. Chizhibisho ichi chakalikulembelwe mumishobo yotatwe, mu chi Hibulu, mu chi Latini, amu chi Giliki. <verse eid="JHN 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21" />Abobo ba paizhi banene baba Juuda bakaambila Pilato ati, “Utalembi ati, ‘Mwami waba Juuda,’ pesi uyu muntu wakaamba ati, ndi mwami waba Juuda.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22" />Pilato wakanviila ati, “Icho nchindakalemba ndalemba.”<verse eid="JHN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23" />Ono bashikalumamba nibakamana kumugagaila Jesu, bakatola zhisani zhakwe akuzhikwamauna muzhipanzha zhili zhone kwaamba aumwi wabo abweze chomwi. Bamane bakabweza achimwi chisani chakwe. Chisani ichi, chakali kujatene kushika anshi. <verse eid="JHN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24" />Abobo bakaambilana ati, “Tutachikwamauni, atuume chisolo kwaamba tubone ushi achibweze.” Ichi chakachitika kuzuzhikizha malembe aamba ati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">“Bakaabana zhisani zhangu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 19:24">alimwi akumina wo chisolo.” Ono nchichechi bashikalumamba nchibakachita.<verse eid="JHN 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25" />Ono kufaafi achingano cha Jesu kwakalinga kwinvi banyina abakwabo banyina, Maliya mukaintu wa Kilopasi, a Maliya waku Magadala. <verse eid="JHN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26" />Jesu nakababona banyina a shichiiya ngwakalinga kuyanda kainvi kufaafi, wakaambila banyina ati, “Mukaintu, ngoyu mwanaako.”<verse eid="JHN 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27" />Alimwi kuli shichiiya uyo wakaamba ati, “Mbaba banyoko.” Ono kuzwa chiindi icho shichiiya uyo wakatola banyina Jesu ku ng'anda yakwe.<verse eid="JHN 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lufu lwa Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mateyo 27.45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Maako 15.33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luuka 23.44-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28" />Muunshi, nakazhiba ati zhintu zhoonse zhamaninina wakaamba alimwi kwaamba malembe azuzikizhigwe, Jesu wakaamba ati, “Ndanva nyotwa.”<verse eid="JHN 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29" />Ono kwakalinga nongo yakalinga kuchite waini usasile. Amane bakanika nsinsa mu waini usasile akwiibika kukasamu akumushonka ku mulomo. <verse eid="JHN 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30" />Jesu wakanwa waini amane wakaamba ati, “Ono kwamana!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:30">Amane wakakotamika mutwi wakwe wafa.<verse eid="JHN 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu wayaswa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31" />Ono bwakalinga buzuba bwakulibambila alimwi bwakalikuchilila bwakalinga buzuba bwandeene bwa Nsabata, nkambo bama sololi baba Juuda taaku nibakalikuyanda kuishiya mibili kailelela azhichingano chiindi cha Nsabata, bakalomba Pilato kwaamba bantu bapopelwe batyolwoolwe myeendo akubagusha azhichingano kabutanakushika buzuba bwa Nsabata. Bakachita ubo nkambo ubo buzuba bwakalinga kulemekelwe kulimbabo. <verse eid="JHN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32" />Abobo bashikalumamba bakaza akutalika kutyola myeendo muntu wakutaanguna wakalinga kugagaililwe a Jesu akuli bamwi. <verse eid="JHN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33" />Pesi nibakashika kuli Jesu bakajana ulifile kale, taaku nibakaityolola myeendo yakwe. <verse eid="JHN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34" />Pesi umwi shikalumamba wakamuyasa lisumo ku lubazu, amane kwakazwa malowa a maanzhi. <verse eid="JHN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35" />Ono muntu wakabona zhintu izhi nguwakapa bumboni, alimwi bumboni bwakwe bwakalinga bwa mashimpe. Wakazhiba ati wakaamba mashimpe, alimwi wakapa bumboni kwaamba ati mushome. <verse eid="JHN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36" />Zhintu izhi zhoonse zhakachitika kwaamba malembe azuzikizhigwe. “Taaku lifuwa lyakwe naliba lyomwi lyakatyolwa.” <verse eid="JHN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37" />Alimwi, mbuli amwi malembe mbwaamba ati, “Balakulanga ali oyo ngubakayasa.”<verse eid="JHN 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu wazhikwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mateyo 27.57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Maako 15.42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luuka 23.50-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38" />Ono Muunshi, Josefa waku Alimatiya wakalomba mubili wa Jesu kuli Pilato. Josefa wakalinga shichiiya wa Jesu, ono chamaseseke nkambo kakutija bamasololi baba Juuda. Pilato wakamuzumizha kubweza mubili akuutola. <verse eid="JHN 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39" />Bakalinga a Nikodimasi uyo wakaswaya Jesu mashiku, wakaletelelela a mafuta atununkilizho tupusene pusene tuunji makkumi chiloba a osanwe kuvula. <verse eid="JHN 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40" />Bakaubweza mubili wa Jesu akuubbutaila mu zhisani antomwi atununkililzho, bweenka mbuli chilengwa chaba Juuda. <verse eid="JHN 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41" />Kwakalinga muunda kubusena uko nkwa kagagailwa Jesu. Mu muunda umo mwakalinga chuumbwe chipya mutana kuzhikwa ko kale muntu. <verse eid="JHN 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42" />Ono nkambo bwakalinga buzuba bwa kulibambila bwa ba Juuda alimwi chuumbwe chakalinga afaafi, bakamuzhika Jesus.<verse eid="JHN 19:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20" />
  <para style="s">Kubuka kwa Jesu kuzwa ku bafu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mateyo 28.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Maako 16.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luuka 24.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1" />Ono buzuba bwakutaanguna bwa Nsondo, anshi kaachishiyashiya, Maliya Magadalena wakashika ku chuumbwe, alimwi wakabona libwe kali kugushilwe kumulyango wa chuumbwe. <verse eid="JHN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2" />Amane wakajoka kabalika kuza kuli Simoni Petulo a shichiiya umwi, eenka Jesu ngwakalinga kuyanda, wakaamba ati, “Bamugusha Mwami mu chuumbwe. Alimwi tatuzhi nkubamubika!”<verse eid="JHN 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3" />Amane Petulo abamwi a shichiiya umwi bakanyamuka akaunka ku chuumbwe. <verse eid="JHN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4" />Boonse bobilo bakabalika, pesi umwi shichiiya wakabalika a kushiya Petulo, wakataanguna kushika ku chuumbwe. <verse eid="JHN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5" />Nakashika wakasondela mu chuumbwe, wakabona boo zhisani kazhilundene anshi, pesi taaku naakanjila mukati. <verse eid="JHN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6" />Muunshi awalo Petulo wakashika, waindilila boo wanjila mukati. Wakabona zhisani kazhilundene, <verse eid="JHN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7" />achalo chisani nchakali kunvumbilwe ku mutwi wa Jesu, achalo takuchakalinga antomwi azhisani nyina. Chakalinga kunvungailwe cheenka kumbali. <verse eid="JHN 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8" />Kumamanino umwi wa bashichiiya, abo bakashika kutaanguna ku chuumbwe, wakanjila mukati, amane wakabona akuzumina. <verse eid="JHN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9" />Nkambo chiindi icho taaku nibakashoma malembe amba ati Jesu ulyeelele kubuka kuzwa kubafu. <verse eid="JHN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10" />Kumane bashichiiya aba bakajokela nkubali kukkala.<verse eid="JHN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu wakalibonya kuli Maliya Magadalena</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Mateyo 28.9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:9-11">Maako 16.9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11" />Pesi Maliya wakalikuinvi ansengwe a chuumbwe kalila. Naakalinga kulila, wakasondela mu chuumbwe <verse eid="JHN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12" />alimwi wakabona bangeli bobilo kabasamine zhisani zhituba buu kabashite awo akalinga kulende mubili wa Jesu. Umwi wakalinga kushite nkwaakalinga kumutwi, umwi nkwakalinga kumyeendo. <verse eid="JHN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13" />Bakamubuzha ati, “Umukaintu nchizhi ncholila?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:13">Walo wakanviila ati, “Bamutola Mwami wangu, alimwi nshizhi nkubamubika!”<verse eid="JHN 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14" />Kuchechi wakachebuka wabona Jesu uliinvi, pesi taaku naakamuzhiba kwaamba ngu Jesu. <verse eid="JHN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15" />Jesu wakamwaambila ati, “Umukaintu, ino ulalila nzhi? Nguni ngolangaula?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:15">Ono Maliya wakayeeya ati ngushikubamba muunda, abobo wakamwaambila ati, “Omuii, naa ndiwe wamulonzhela kumbi, kontondezha kamubweze.”<verse eid="JHN 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16" />Jesu wakamwaambila ati,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:16">“Maliya!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:16">Nakachebuka wakaamba muchi Alamikki ati, “Rabboni!” (Mu Chihibulu chaamba ati, “Muii.”)<verse eid="JHN 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17" />Jesu wakamwaambila ati, “Utanjati,” Jesu wakamwaambila ati, “Nkambo nshina kuunka kuli Taata. Pesi kounka ku bamakwesu ubaambile ati, ndaunka kuli Taata, uyo uli ngu Ishiwanu andimwe. Ndaunka kuli Leza wangu, Leza wanu andimwe.”<verse eid="JHN 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18" />Maliya Magadalena wakaunka a kwaambila bashichiiya makani akwaamba ndamubona Mwami. ngu nguwe wangambila zhintu izhi.<verse eid="JHN 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu wabonekela ku bashichiiya bakwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mateyo 28.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Maako 16.14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luuka 24.36-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19" />Kumangolezha, buzuba bwakutaanguna mu Nsondo bweenka ubo bashichiiya kabali antomwi, a milyango ya ng'anda kaikkilwe nkambo bakalinga kutija bamasololi baba Juuda. Ono Jesu wakashika, waima akati kabo wakabaambila ati, “Luumuno lube andimwe.” <verse eid="JHN 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20" />Nakamana kwaamba chechi, wakabatondezha maanza akwe alubazu lwakwe. Abobo bashichiiya bakakomana nibakabona Mwami wabo. <verse eid="JHN 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21" />Alimwi Jesu wakabaambila ati, “Lumuno lube andimwe. Bweenka Taata mbwakantuma anshi aano, andime ndamutuma.” <verse eid="JHN 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22" />Nakamana boo kwaamba, wakabayoyela Muuya, wakaamba ati, “Amutambule Muuya Usalala. <verse eid="JHN 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23" />Naa mwalekelela bantu zhinyonyono, balalekelelwa, naa mwabula kubalekelela, tabalekelelwi.”<verse eid="JHN 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu wabonekela kuli Tomasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24" />Pesi Tomasi uyo wakalinga umwi wabashichiiya (Wiitwa ati Mpuundu), taaku nakalinga wo chiindi Jesu nakashika ku bashichiiya bamwi. <verse eid="JHN 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25" />Ono bashichiiya bamwi bakamwaambila ati, “Twamubona Mwami!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:25">Tomasi wakaamba ati, “Chita boo mbone zhilonda mwakapopwa mumaanza akwe akubika maanza angu mulubazu teenshi nshome.” <verse eid="JHN 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26" />Nikwakainda nsondo yomwi, alimwi bashichiiya bakalinga mu ng'anda antomwi a Tomasi. Pesi zhitendele kazhi kiilwe, abobo Jesu wakashika akwimikana akati kabo waamba ati, “Lumuno lube andimwe.” <verse eid="JHN 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27" />Amane wakaambila Tomasi ati, “Biika munwe wako awa, bona maanza angu. Uzhibe kwaamba ndime. Tandabika lyaanza lyako kulubazu lwangu, kwaamba uchileke kutonsha, pesi ushome!”<verse eid="JHN 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28" />Tomasi wakamunviila ati, “Mwami wangu, a Leza wangu!”<verse eid="JHN 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29" />Jesu wakamwaambila ati, “Ono wazumina nkambo wambona. Balilelekelwe abo bazumina kabatana kubona!”<verse eid="JHN 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muzeezo wa libbuku ili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30" />Ono a zhimwi zhitondezho zhiinji zhanguzu Jesu nzhakachita kubushu bwabashichiiya zhitana kulembwa mu libbuku ili. <verse eid="JHN 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31" />Pesi izhi zhakalembwa kwaamba mushome ati Jesu ngu Mesiya, Mwana Leza, a kwaamba mwamushoma mukabe a buumi mu liina lyakwe.<verse eid="JHN 20:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21" />
  <para style="s">Jesu wabonekela ku bashichiiya bali chiloba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1" />Nikwakamana Jesu wakabonekela alimwi ku bashichiiya bakwe, ku lweenge lwa Tibeliyasi. Ono mboobu mbuchakachitika. <verse eid="JHN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2" />Simoni Petulo a Tomasi wiitwa mpuundu a Nasaneli waku Kana mu Galilii a bana a Zebedi a bamwi bashichiiya bobilo bakalinga antomwi. <verse eid="JHN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3" />Saimoni Petulo wakaambila bamwi ati, “Ime ndajokela mukuzela nswi,”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:3">alimwi bakaamba ati, “Tulaunka andiwe,” abobo bakazwa ansengwe akunjila mu bwaato, pesi mashiku taaku nibakajata chili choonse. <verse eid="JHN 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4" />Kuseeniseni, Jesu wakashika waima kumbali a maaanzhi, pesi bashichiiya taaku nibakazhiba kwaamba ngu Jesu. <verse eid="JHN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5" />Jesu wakabaita, nubeenzuma, “Saa taaku nchimwajata?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:5">Abalo bakaamba ati, “Taaku.”<verse eid="JHN 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6" />Wakabaambila ati, “Amuwaale ntangala kululyo a bwaato bwanu mulajata zhimwi.” Nibakachita boo, taaku nibakalinga kuchikonzha kukwela, nkambo kakuvula kwa nswi.<verse eid="JHN 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7" />Kumana eenka shichiiya uyo ngwakalinga kuyanda Jesu wakaambila Petulo ati, “Ngu Mwami!” Saimoni Petulo nakanva kwaamba ati, ngu Mwami, wakalivumba chisani chakwe nkambo wakalinga kufuulile wakaliwaalila mu maanzhi. <verse eid="JHN 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8" />Bamwi bashichiiya bakachilila mu bwaato, kabaya kukwela ntangala yabo kaizwile nswi. Bakalinga afaafi, bulaanfu bwantaamu zhilimwanda omwi. <verse eid="JHN 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9" />Nibakazwa mu maanzhi akuzubukila atala, bakabona mulilo wamakalangasha, answi kazhiyokwa awo, alimwi kwakalinga a chinkwa ambali. <verse eid="JHN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10" />Jesu wakabambila ati, “Amulete zhimwi nswi nzhimwazwa kujata.”<verse eid="JHN 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11" />Abobo Saimoni Petulo wakanjila mu bwaato, wakwela ntangala yomwi yalikuzwile nswi zhinene, pesi zhakalinga mwaanda amakkumi osanwe azhotatwe, pesi ntangala taaku niyakakwamuka. <verse eid="JHN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12" />Jesu wakabaambila ati, “Kamuza mulye.” Pesi taaku shichiiya wakasola kumubuzha ati, “Ndiwe nii?” Bakalikuzhi kwaamba ngu Mwami. <verse eid="JHN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13" />Jesu wakabweza chinkwa akubapa. Alimwi Wakachita bweenka ku nswi ayalo.<verse eid="JHN 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14" />Ichi chakalinga chiindi cha tatu Jesu kubonekela ku bashichiiya bakwe kabukile kuzwa kubafu.<verse eid="JHN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu a Petulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15" />Nibakamana kulya Jesu wakaambila Petulo ati, “Saimoni mwana a Joni, saa ulanyanda kwiinda baaba?” Walo wakanviila ati, “Eye, O Mwami, ulizhi kwaamba ati ndakuyanda.” Peenka Jesu wakaamba ati, “Sanina tubelele twangu.” <verse eid="JHN 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16" />Alimwi alwabili wakamwaambila ati, “Saimoni mwana a Joni, saa ulanyanda?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Petulo wakaamba ati,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">“Eye, Mwami, ulizhi kwaamba ndakuyanda?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Jesu wakamwaambila ati, “Baamba mbelele zhangu.” <verse eid="JHN 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17" />Alimwi alwatatu Jesu wakamwaambila ati, Simoni, mwana a Joni, saa ulanyanda?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Ono Petulo wakausa nkambo Jesu wakamubuzha lwatatu ati, “Saa ulanyanda?” Abobo wakamwaambila ati, “O Mwami ulizhi zhintu zhoonse. Ulizhi kwaamba ati ndakuyanda!” Jesu wakamwaambila ati, “Sanina mbelele zhangu. <verse eid="JHN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18" />Kashimpe ndamwambila, nimwakachilinga baana mwakalinga kulisamika nubeene a kweenda, kouunka kufumbwa nkumwakalinga kuyanda. Pesi wakuchembaala, ulakutandabika maanza amane muntu umwi ulakukusamika akukutola ankotayandi kuunka koonse.” <verse eid="JHN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19" />Jesu wakaamba ichi kwaamba ati abazhibishe lufu neshi akafe Petulo kwaamba Leza apegwa bulemu amane wakamwambila ati, “Nchilile!”<verse eid="JHN 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu abashichiiya bamwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20" />Naakachebuka Petulo, wakabona shichiiya uyo ngwakalinga kuyanda Jesu kabachilila. Nguguwe uyo wakalikuyeeme kuli Jesu chiindi nibakalinga kulya mulalilo wamamanino, akubuzha ati, Mwami nguni eshi akakwaabe?” <verse eid="JHN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21" />Amane Petulo nakamubona, wakabuzha ati, “O Mwami, ino uyu?”<verse eid="JHN 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22" />Jesu wakanviila ati, “Ino naa nkanyanda kwaamba apone kushikila nkanjoke ino chilakupenzha nzhi? Nchilile!”<verse eid="JHN 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23" />Nkambo kachechi, ipuwo yakashika kubashomi kwaamba shichiiya uyu takafi. Pesi Jesu taaku nakaamba ati takafi, ono wakaamba boo ati, “Naa ndayanda kwaamba atakafi kapona kushikilaa ime nkanjoke, ino chila kupenzha nzhi?”<verse eid="JHN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24" />Uyu ngu shichiiya wakapa bumboni kuzhintu izhi, alimwi ngu nguwe wakalemba, abobo tulizhi ati bumboni bwakwe mbwa mashimpe.<verse eid="JHN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mukumanizha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25" />Jesu awalo wakachita zhimwi zhintu zhiinji. Nizhakalembwa zhoonse, niinga taaku busena bwakubika mabbuku ayo muno munyika.<verse eid="JHN 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21" />
</usx>